helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3150402				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BEZIER_TOOLBOX\"\>The \<emph\>Edit Points \</emph\>Bar appears when you select a polygon object and click \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3144762				0	sk	Daná funkcia vám umožňuje upravovať body krivky alebo objektu prevedeného na krivku. Dostupné sú tieto ikony:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105				0	sk	Upraviť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3159151				0	sk	The \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05270000.xhp\" name=\"Edit Points\"\>\<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\>\</link\> icon allows you to activate or deactivate the edit mode for Bézier objects. In the edit mode, individual points of the drawing object can be selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3145366				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3153951\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_toggleobjectbeziermode.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3153951\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3150105				0	sk	Upraviť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146976				0	sk	Presunúť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierMove\"\>Activates a mode in which you can move points.\</ahelp\> The mouse pointer displays a small empty square when resting on a point. Drag that point to another location. The curve on both sides of the point follows the movement; the section of the curve between the next points changes shape.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3149481				0	sk	Ak kliknete na krivku medzi dvoma bodmi alebo vo vnútry uzatvorenej krivky, môžete pretiahnúť krivku na nové miesto bez toho, aby ste zmenili jej tvar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3154096				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3149377\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_beziermove.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149377\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147397				0	sk	Presunúť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150115				0	sk	Vložiť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3160478				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierInsert\"\>Activates the insert mode. This mode allows you to insert points.\</ahelp\> You can also move points, just as in the move mode. If, however, you click at the curve between two points and move the mouse a little while holding down the mouse button you insert a new point. The point is a smooth point, and the lines to the control points are parallel and remain so when moved.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3157846				0	sk	If you wish to create a corner point you must first insert either a smooth or a symmetrical point which is then converted to a corner point by using \<emph\>Corner Point\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3153838				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3146969\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bezierinsert.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146969\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3153710				0	sk	Vložiť body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149020				0	sk	Zmazať body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3148917				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierDelete\"\>Use the \<emph\>Delete Points\</emph\> icon to delete one or several selected points. If you wish to select several points click the appropriate points while holding down the Shift key.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3153766				0	sk	Najskôr vyberte bod, ktorý chcete odstrániť, a potom kliknite na túto ikonu alebo stlačte klávesu Del.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3147321				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3146920\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bezierdelete.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3146920\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3155961				0	sk	Zmazať body				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147361				0	sk	Rozdeliť krivku				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3151248				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierCutLine\"\>The\<emph\> Split Curve \</emph\>icon splits a curve. Select the point or points where you want to split the curve, then click the icon\</ahelp\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3153788				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3148489\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_beziercutline.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148489\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3152581				0	sk	Rozdeliť krivku				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150345				0	sk	Convert To Curve				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3148420				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierConvert\"\>Converts a curve into a straight line or converts a straight line into a curve.\</ahelp\> If you select a single point, the curve before the point will be converted. If two points are selected, the curve between both points will be converted. If you select more than two points, each time you click this icon, a different portion of the curve will be converted. If necessary, round points are converted into corner points and corner points are converted into round points.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3150304				0	sk	Ak medzi dvoma bodmi leží priama časť, majú obidva koncové body iba jeden riadiaci bod. Tieto body nemôžu byť prevedené na hladké body dovtedy, pokiaľ neprevediete čiaru medzi nimi na krivku.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3158212				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3149036\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_bezierconvert.png\" width=\"0.222inch\" height=\"0.222inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3149036\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
