helpcontent2	source\text\shared\main0227.xhp	0	help	par_id3156032				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:BezierClose\"\>Closes a line or a curve.\</ahelp\> A line is closed by connecting the last point with the first point, indicated by an enlarged square.				20200411 15:09:53
