helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	sk	\<emph\>Start, End:\</emph\> Numerical values or constants that define the number of elements (NumberElements=(end-start)+1) and the index range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155307				0	sk	Start and End can be numeric expressions if ReDim is used at the procedure level.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102101.xhp	0	help	par_id3153951				0	sk	\<emph\>VarType:\</emph\> Keyword that declares the data type of a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
