helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145068				0	sk	Use the following statements and functions to define the way $[officename] Basic reacts to run-time errors.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148946				0	sk	$[officename] Basic offers several methods to prevent the termination of a program when a run-time error occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
