helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3159413				0	sk	Calculates the cosine of an angle. The angle is specified in radians. The result lies between -1 and 1.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3150358				0	sk	Using the angle Alpha, the Cos-Function calculates the ratio of the length of the side that is adjacent to the angle, divided by the length of the hypotenuse in a right-angled triangle.				20200411 15:09:53
