helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3146985				0	sk	radian=(degree*pi)/180				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03080102.xhp	0	help	par_id3152885				0	sk	Pi is here the fixed circle constant with the rounded value 3.14159...				20200411 15:09:53
