helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150682				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/sbasic/shared/03110100.xhp\" name=\"Comparison Operators [Runtime]\"\>Comparison Operators [Runtime]\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156042				0	sk	Comparison operators compare two expressions. The result is returned as a Boolean expression that determines if the comparison is True (-1) or False (0).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147291				0	sk	Syntax:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	sk	Result = Expression1 { = | < | > | <= | >= } Expression2				20200411 15:09:53
