helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147573				0	sk	\<emph\>Result:\</emph\> Boolean expression that specifies the result of the comparison (True, or False)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03110100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148686				0	sk	\<emph\>Expression1, Expression2:\</emph\> Any numeric values or strings that you want to compare.				20200411 15:09:53
