helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01050100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155132				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_BASICIDE_WATCHWINDOW_EDIT\"\>Enter the name of the variable whose value is to be monitored.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
