helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03020413.xhp	0	help	par_id3153192				0	sk	If the path is not determined, the \<emph\>RmDir Statement\</emph\> searches for the directory that you want to delete in the current path. If it is not found there, an error message appears.				20200411 15:09:53
