helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A2				0	sk	REM always use a period as decimal delimiter when you enter numbers in Basic source code.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03120301.xhp	0	help	par_id3147339				0	sk	REM displays for example 6,328.20 in English locale, 6.328,20 in German locale.				20200411 15:09:53
