helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153765				0	sk	...before a $[officename] application is terminated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145150				0	sk	Vytvoriť dokument				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\01040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3163808				0	sk	...after a new document is created with \<emph\>File - New\</emph\> or with the \<emph\>New\</emph\> icon.				20200411 15:09:53
