helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3143271				0	sk	Declares a variable or an array.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154686				0	sk	If the variables are separated by commas (for example, DIM sPar1, sPar2, sPar3 AS STRING), only Variant variables can be defined. Use a separate definition line for each variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03102100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	sk	DIM sPar1 AS STRING				20200411 15:09:53
