helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Translation of Controls in the Dialog Editor				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	bm_id8915372				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>dialogs;translating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>localizing dialogs\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>translating dialogs\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	hd_id3574896				0	sk	\<variable id=\"translation\"\>\<link href=\"text/sbasic/guide/translation.xhp\"\>Translation of Controls in the Dialog Editor\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4601940				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The Language toolbar in the Basic IDE dialog editor shows controls to enable and manage localizable dialogs.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id9538560				0	sk	Štandardne vytvorené dialógové okno obsahuje reťazce len pre jeden jazyk. Je možné že budete chcieť vytvoriť dialógové okná, ktoré zobrazia lokalizované reťazce podľa jazyka nastaveného používateľom.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the language for the strings that you want to edit. Click the Manage Languages icon to add languages.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id71413				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click a language, then click Default to set the language as default, or click Delete to remove the language from the list.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2924283				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Otvorte dialógové okno, v ktorom môžete jazyk do zoznamu pridať.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5781731				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select a language in the list and click Delete to remove that language. When you remove all languages, the string resources for localizable dialogs are removed from all dialogs in the current library.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6942045				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Vyberte jazyk v zozname a kliknite na Východzie, tým nastavíte jazyk ako východzí.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4721823				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The default language will be used as a source for all other language strings.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5806756				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Add UI languages for your dialog strings.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	hd_id6596881				0	sk	To enable localizable dialogs				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8750572				0	sk	In the Basic IDE dialog editor, open the Language toolbar choosing \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>View - Toolbars - Language\</item\>. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2224494				0	sk	If the current library already contains a localizable dialog, the Language toolbar is shown automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id7359233				0	sk	Click the \<emph\>Manage Languages\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id2526017\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_managelanguage.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id2526017\"\>Manage Language icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the Language toolbar or on the Toolbox bar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6549272				0	sk	Otvorí sa dialógové okno Spravovať jazyky používateľského rozhrania. V tomto dialógovom okne sa dajú spravovať jazyky aktuálnej knižnice. Názov aktuálnej knižnice sa zobrazuje v titulnom panely okna.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id6529740				0	sk	Click Add in the dialog to add a language entry. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id7811822				0	sk	This step enables all new dialogs to contain localizable string resources.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id9121982				0	sk	Keď kliknete prvý krát na Pridať, zobrazí sa dialógové okno Nastaviť východzí jazyky používateľského rozhrania. Ak na tlačidlo Pridať kliknete potom, zobrazí sa dialógové okno s názvom Pridať jazyky používateľského rozhrania.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3640247				0	sk	You can also change the default language in the Manage User Interface Language dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3808404				0	sk	Select a language. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id4585100				0	sk	This adds string resources to contain the translated versions of all strings to the dialog properties. The set of dialog strings of the default language is copied to the new set of strings. Later, you can switch to the new language and then translate the strings.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2394482				0	sk	Zavrite dialógové okno alebo zvoľte ďalší jazyk.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	hd_id631733				0	sk	To edit localizable controls in your dialog				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2334665				0	sk	Once you have added the resources for localizable strings in your dialogs, you can select the current language from the Current Language listbox on the Language toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8956572				0	sk	Switch the Current Language listbox to display the default language.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id500808				0	sk	Insert any number of controls to your dialog and enter all strings you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id8366649				0	sk	Select another language in the Current Language listbox.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id476393				0	sk	Using the control's property dialogs, edit all strings to the other language.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id2655720				0	sk	Repeat for all languages that you added.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3682058				0	sk	The user of your dialog will see the strings of the user interface language of the user's version of %PRODUCTNAME, if you did provide strings in that language. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id5977965				0	sk	If no language matches the user's version, the user will see the default language strings. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\guide\translation.xhp	0	help	par_id3050325				0	sk	If the user has an older version of %PRODUCTNAME that does not know localizable string resources for Basic dialogs, the user will see the default language strings.				20200411 15:09:53
