helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153049				0	sk	On the \<emph\>Mail & News\</emph\> page in the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/09070000.xhp\" name=\"Hyperlink dialog\"\>Hyperlink dialog\</link\> you can edit hyperlinks for e-mail or news addresses.				20200411 15:09:53
