helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\09070200.xhp	0	help	par_id3166460				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_RADIOBUTTON_RID_SVXPAGE_HYPERLINK_MAIL_RB_LINKTYP_MAIL\"\>Assigns the specified e-mail address to the hyperlink.\</ahelp\> Clicking the new hyperlink in the document will open a new message document, addressed to the receiver specified in the \<emph\>E-mail\</emph\> field.				20200411 15:09:53
