helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145744				0	sk	Returns all fields containing the search pattern anywhere in the field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148451				0	sk	na začiatku poľa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\12100200.xhp	0	help	par_id3155429				0	sk	Returns all fields containing the search pattern at the beginning of the field.				20200411 15:09:53
