helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1082F				0	sk	Saves the current record, if necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN10835				0	sk	Zmeniť vstupné dáta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1083A				0	sk	Reverses the changes in the current record.				20200411 15:09:53
