helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154638				0	sk	Stránkovanie dole				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152577	20			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DROPDOWN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies whether the combo box should dropdown (Yes) or not (No).\</ahelp\>A control field with the dropdown property has an additional arrow button which opens the list of the existing form entries per mouse click. Under \<emph\>Line count\</emph\>, you can specify how many lines (or rows) should be displayed in the dropdown state. Combination fields can have the dropdown property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159198				0	sk	Combo boxes that were inserted as columns in a table control are always dropdown as the default.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153140				0	sk	Alignment / Graphics alignment				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151281	12			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ALIGN\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the alignment option for text or graphics that are used on a control.\</ahelp\>The alignment options are left-aligned, right-aligned, and centered. These options are available for the following elements:				20200411 15:09:53
