helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN1154E				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies if a Push Button behaves as a Toggle Button. If you set Toggle to "Yes", you can switch between the "selected" and "not selected" control states when you click the button or press the spacebar while the the control has the focus. A button in the "selected" state appears "pressed in".\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
