helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146096	138			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DECIMAL_ACCURACY\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Determines the number of digits displayed to the right of the decimal point.\</ahelp\>With numerical and currency fields you can determine the number of digits displayed to the right of the decimal point.				20200411 15:09:53
