helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id4563127				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets the default text for a text box or a combo box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145206				0	sk	Východzie tlačidlo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154681	145			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_DEFAULT_BUTTON\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key.\</ahelp\>The\<emph\> Default button\</emph\> property specifies that the corresponding button will be operated when you press the Return key. If you open the dialog or form and do not carry out any further action, the button with this property is the default button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3149750				0	sk	This property should be assigned only to a single button within the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150931				0	sk	When using Web page forms, you might come across this property in search masks. These are edit masks that contain a text field and a Submit type button. The search term is entered in the text field and the search is started by activating the button. If the button is defined as the default button, however, simply hit Enter after entering the search term in order to start the search.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153389				0	sk	Symbol pre predponu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3150271				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRSYM_POSITION\"\>Determines if the currency symbol is displayed before or after the number when using currency fields.\</ahelp\> The default setting is currency symbols are not prefixed.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154548				0	sk	Krok tabulátora				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155361	49			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TABSTOP\"\>The \<emph\>Tabstop \</emph\>property determines if a control field can be selected with the tab key.\</ahelp\> The following options are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148627				0	sk	Nie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3161673				0	sk	When using the tab key, focusing skips the control.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159323				0	sk	Áno				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148584				0	sk	The control can be selected with the Tab key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146909				0	sk	Oddeľovač tisícok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154936	148			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_SHOWTHOUSANDSEP\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Inserts a thousands separator.\</ahelp\>With numerical and currency fields you can determine whether thousands separators are used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156256				0	sk	Označenie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3156432	8			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LABEL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>The Label property sets the label of the control field that is displayed in the form.\</ahelp\>The Label property sets the label of the control field that is displayed in the form. This property determines the visible label or the column header of the data field in table control forms.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154568				0	sk	When you create a new control, the description predefined in the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> property is used as the default for labeling the control. The label consists of the control field name and an integer numbering the control (for example, CommandButton1). With the \<emph\>Title\</emph\> property, you can assign another description to the control so that the label reflects the function of the control. Change this entry in order to assign an expressive label to the control that is visible to the user.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163820				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>multi-line titles in forms\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>names; multi-line titles\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>controls; multi-line titles\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3163820				0	sk	To create a multi-line title, open the combo box using the arrow button. You can enter a line break by pressing Shift+\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3159407				0	sk	The \<emph\>Title\</emph\> property is only used for labeling a form element in the interface visible to the user. If you work with macros, note that at runtime, a control is always addressed through the \<emph\>Name\</emph\> property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150293				0	sk	URL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154358	57			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_TARGET_URL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the URL address that opens when you click an "Open document / web page" button.\</ahelp\>Enter the URL address for a Open document or web page button type in the \<emph\>URL\</emph\> box. The address opens when you click the button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146074				0	sk	If you move the mouse over the button in User mode, the URL appears as the extended tip, provided that no other Help text was entered.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147134				0	sk	Symbol meny				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3145160	150			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_CURRENCYSYMBOL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>You can enter a character or a string for the currency symbol.\</ahelp\>In a currency field, you can pre-define the currency symbol by entering the character or string in the \<emph\>Currency symbol\</emph\> property.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144444				0	sk	Hodnota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152417	155			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_HIDDEN_VALUE\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>You can enter the data that is inherited by the hidden control.\</ahelp\>In a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170600.xhp\" name=\"hidden control\"\>hidden control\</link\>, under \<emph\>Value\</emph\>, you can enter the data which is inherited by the hidden control. This data will be transferred when sending the form.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157315				0	sk	Znaky hesla				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155323	157			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ECHO_CHAR\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>If the text box is used as a password input, enter the ASCII-code of the display character. This character is displayed instead of the characters typed by the user for the password.\</ahelp\>If the user enters a password, you can determine the characters that will be displayed instead of the characters typed by the user. Under \<emph\>Password character\</emph\>, enter the ASCII code of the desired character. You can use the values from 0 to 255.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3152493				0	sk	The characters and their ASCII codes can be seen in the \<emph\>Special Characters\</emph\> dialog (Insert - Special Character).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157884				0	sk	Znaková maska				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3157557	160			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_LITERALMASK\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Defines the literal mask. The literal mask contains the initial values and is always visible after downloading a form.\</ahelp\>With masked fields you can specify a literal mask. A literal mask contains the initial values of a form, and is always visible after downloading a form. Using a character code for the Edit mask, you can determine the entries that the user can type into the masked field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3148513				0	sk	The length of the literal mask should always correspond to the length of the edit mask. If this is not the case, the edit mask is either cut off or filled with blanks up to the length of the edit mask.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146762				0	sk	Písmo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3151037	6			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_FONT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select the font for the text that is in the control field.\</ahelp\>For control fields which have visible text or titles, select the display font that you want to use. To open the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Font\"\>\<emph\>Font\</emph\>\</link\> dialog, click the \<emph\>...\</emph\> button. The selected font is used in control fields names and to display data in table control fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156734				0	sk	Výška riadka				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_id3160455	163			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_PROP_ROWHEIGHT\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Specifies the row height of a table control field.\</ahelp\>In table controls, enter a value for the row height. If you want, you can enter a value followed by valid measurement unit, for example, 2 cm.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FB6				0	sk	Textové riadky končia s				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170101.xhp	0	help	par_idN11FBA				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For text fields, select the line end code to be used when writing text into a database column.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
