helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3159197				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Ellipse\"\>Draws an oval where you drag in the current document. Click where you want to draw the oval, and drag to the size you want. To draw a circle, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
