helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3158444				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Edit\"\>Creates a text box.\</ahelp\> Text boxes are fields in which the user can enter text. In a form, text boxes display data or allow for new data input.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151218				0	sk	Formátované pole				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154836				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3143277\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_formattedfield.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3143277\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147547				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormattedField\"\>Creates a formatted field.\</ahelp\> A formatted field is a text box in which you can define how the inputs and outputs are formatted, and which limiting values apply.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155346				0	sk	A formatted field has \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170002.xhp\" name=\"special control properties\"\>special control properties\</link\> (choose \<emph\>Format - Control\</emph\>).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148774				0	sk	Tlačidlo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145801				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3151073\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertpushbutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151073\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147046				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Pushbutton\"\>Creates a push button.\</ahelp\> This function can be used to execute a command for a defined event, such as a mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154731				0	sk	You can apply text and graphics to these buttons.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157844				0	sk	Tlačidlo možností				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152971				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3152999\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_radiobutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152999\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149123				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:RadioButton\"\>Creates an option button.\</ahelp\> Option buttons enable the user to choose one of several options. Option buttons with the same functionality are given the same name (\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170101.xhp\" name=\"Name\"\>\<emph\>Name\</emph\>\</link\>\<emph\>property\</emph\>). Normally, they are given a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170000.xhp\" name=\"group box\"\>group box\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156064				0	sk	Pole zoznamu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154326				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3154135\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_listbox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154135\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ListBox\"\>Creates a list box.\</ahelp\> A list box lets users select an entry from a list. If the form is linked to a database and the database connection is active, the\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170900.xhp\" name=\"List Box Wizard\"\>\<emph\>List Box Wizard\</emph\>\</link\> will automatically appear after the list box is inserted in the document. This wizard helps you create the list box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147171				0	sk	Combo pole				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149981				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3148817\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_combobox.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148817\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149407				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ComboBox\"\>Creates a combo box.\</ahelp\> A combo box is a single-line list box with a drop-down list from which users choose an option. You can assign the "read-only" property to the combo box so that users cannot enter other entries than those found in the list. If the form is bound to a database and the database connection is active, the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170900.xhp\" name=\"Combo Box Wizard\"\>\<emph\>Combo Box Wizard\</emph\>\</link\> will automatically appear after you insert the combo box in the document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145618				0	sk	Popisné pole				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145295				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3151017\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_insertfixedtext.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3151017\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148534				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:Label\"\>Creates a field for displaying text.\</ahelp\> These labels are only for displaying predefined text. Entries cannot be made in these fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CC6				0	sk	Viac ovládacích prvkov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10CDC				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Opens the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/more_controls.xhp\"\>\<emph\>More Controls\</emph\>\</link\> toolbar.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
