helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B65				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id6128727\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_usewizards.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id6128727\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11B76				0	sk	Turns on and turns off the automatic form controls wizards.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id6403088				0	sk	These wizards help you to enter the properties of list boxes, table controls, and other controls.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149436				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170001.xhp\" name=\"Context Menu Commands\"\>Context Menu Commands\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A56				0	sk	Rolovacie tlačidlo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A64				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id7816400\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_spinbutton.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id7816400\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11A75				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:SpinButton\"\>Creates a spin button.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id710776				0	sk	If you add a spin button to a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between the spin button and a cell. As a result, when you change the contents of a cell, the contents of the spin button are updated. Conversely, if you change the value of the spin button, the contents of the cell are updated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ABC				0	sk	Posuvný panel				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ACA				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id8203985\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_scrollbar.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id8203985\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11ADB				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:ScrollBar\"\>Creates a scrollbar.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CA3				0	sk	You can specify the following properties for a scrollbar:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CDA				0	sk	UI názov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE0				0	sk	Sémantiky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CE7				0	sk	Scroll value min				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CED				0	sk	Specifies the minimum height or the minimum width of a scrollbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CF4				0	sk	Scroll value max				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11CFA				0	sk	Specifies the maximum height or the maximum width of a scrollbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D01				0	sk	Východzia veľkosť posunu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D07				0	sk	Specifies the default value of a scrollbar, used when the form is reset.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D0E				0	sk	Orientácia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D14				0	sk	Specifies the orientation of a scrollbar, that is, horizontal or vertical.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D1B				0	sk	Malá zmena				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D21				0	sk	Specifies the minimum amount by which you can scroll a scrollbar, for example, by clicking an arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D28				0	sk	Veľká zmena				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D2E				0	sk	Specifies the amount that a large step scrolls a scrollbar, for example, when you click between the scrollbar thumb and a scrollbar arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D35				0	sk	Pozdržať				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D3B				0	sk	Specifies the delay in milliseconds between scrollbar trigger events. For example, the delay that occurs when you click an arrow button on the scrollbar and hold down the mouse button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D42				0	sk	Farba symbolu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D48				0	sk	Specifies the color of the arrows on the scrollbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D4F				0	sk	Viditeľná veľkosť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D55				0	sk	Specifies the size of the scrollbar thumb in "value units". For example, a value of ("Scroll value max." minus "Scroll value min.") / 2 results in a scrollbar thumb that occupies half of the scrollbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D58				0	sk	To make the width of the scrollbar equal to the height of the scrollbar, set the Visible Size to zero.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_idN11D63				0	sk	In a Calc spreadsheet, you can use the Data tab page to create a two-way link between a scrollbar and a cell.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153316				0	sk	Obrázkové tlačidlo				20200411 15:09:53
