helpcontent2	source\text\shared\02\01170000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150122				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:PatternField\"\>Creates a pattern field.\</ahelp\> Pattern fields consist of an edit mask and a literal mask. The edit mask determines which data can be entered. The literal mask determines the contents of the pattern field when loading the form.				20200411 15:09:53
