helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3149651				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_RESET_BTN\"\>Resets changes made to the current tab to those applicable when this dialog was opened. A confirmation query does not appear when you close the dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
