helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154153				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_TABDLG_STANDARD_BTN\"\>Resets the values visible in the dialog back to the default installation values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000001.xhp	0	help	par_id3154299				0	sk	Potvrdenie sa nezobrazí skôr, ako sú opätovne nahrané štandardné hodnoty.				20200411 15:09:53
