helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000208.xhp	0	help	par_id3147377				0	sk	Shows how the imported text will look after it is separated into columns. To apply a format to a column when it is imported, click a column and select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>. When you select a \<emph\>Column type\</emph\>, the column heading displays the applied format.				20200411 15:09:53
