helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Slovník internetových termínov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150702				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>common terms;Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>glossaries;Internet terms\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>terminology;Internet glossary\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150702				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp\" name=\"Glossary of Internet Terms\"\>Glossary of Internet Terms\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155577				0	sk	Ak ste začiatočník, na internete budete prichádzať do styku s neznámymi termínmi: browser - prehliadač, bookmark - záložka, e-mail, homepage - domovská stránka, search engine - vyhľadávač a mnoho iných. Pre uľahčenie vašich prvých krokov slúži tento slovník vysvetľujúci niektoré z najdôležitejších termínov, ktoré sa vyskytujú na internete, intranete, v pošte a správach.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153146				0	sk	Rámce				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3157909				0	sk	Frames are useful for designing the layout of \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> pages. $[officename] uses floating frames into which you can place objects such as graphics, movie files and sound. The context menu of a frame shows the options for restoring or editing frame contents. Some of these commands are also listed in \<emph\>Edit - Object\</emph\> when the frame is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147077				0	sk	FTP				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	sk	FTP stands for File Transfer Protocol and is the standard transfer protocol for files in the Internet. An FTP server is a program on a computer connected to the Internet which stores files to be transmitted with the aid of FTP. While FTP is responsible for transmitting and downloading Internet files, \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#http\" name=\"HTTP\"\>HTTP\</link\> (Hypertext Transfer Protocol) provides the connection setup and data transfer between WWW servers and clients.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145609				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>HTML; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145609				0	sk	HTML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3161459				0	sk	HTML (Hypertext Markup Language) is a document code language, which is used as the file format for WWW documents. It is derived from \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#sgml\" name=\"SGML\"\>SGML\</link\> and integrates text, graphics, videos and sound.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154346	58			0	sk	If you want to type HTML commands directly, for example when doing exercises from one of the many available HTML books, remember that HTML pages are pure text files. Save your document under the document type \<emph\>Text \</emph\>and give it the file name extension .HTML. Be sure there are no umlauts or other special characters of the extended character set. If you want to re-open this file in $[officename] and edit the HTML code, you must load it with the file type \<emph\>Text\</emph\> and not with the file type \<emph\>Web pages\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153960				0	sk	Na internete je veľké množstvo odkazov poskytujúcich úvod do jazyka HTML.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147423				0	sk	HTTP				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153379				0	sk	HTTP (HyperText Transfer Protocol) je protokol na prenos WWW dokumentov (hypertextu) z webového servera do webového prehliadača používateľa (klienta).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149290				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>hyperlinks; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149290				0	sk	Hypertextový odkaz				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145420				0	sk	Hypertextové odkazy sú krížové odkazy, zvýraznené v texte rôznymi farbami a aktivované kliknutím myšou. Pomocou hypertextových odkazov, môže čitateľ skočiť na zvláštne informácie vo vnútri dokumentu, ale taktiež na súvisiace informácie v iných dokumentoch.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156281				0	sk	V $[officename] môžete priradiť hypertextové odkazy textu, grafike a textovému rámcu (pozrite si ikonu Hypertextový odkaz na paneli Štandardný).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152805				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>ImageMap; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152805				0	sk	Obrázková mapa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154685				0	sk	An ImageMap is a reference-sensitive graphic or text frame. You can click on defined areas of the graphic or text frame to go to a target (\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\>), which is linked with the area. The reference areas, along with the linked URLs and corresponding text displayed when resting the mouse pointer on these areas, are defined in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02220000.xhp\" name=\"ImageMap Editor\"\>ImageMap Editor\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153178				0	sk	There are two different types of ImageMaps. A Client Side ImageMap is evaluated on the client computer, which loaded the graphic from the Internet, while a Server Side ImageMap is evaluated on the server computer which provides the \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> page on the Internet. In server evaluation, clicking an ImageMap sends the relative coordinates of the cursor within the image to the server, and a dedicated program on the server responds. In the client evaluation, clicking a defined hotspot of the ImageMap activates the URL, as if it were a normal text link. The URL appears below the mouse pointer when passing across the ImageMap.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150740				0	sk	Obrazové mapy môžu byť použité rôznym spôsobom a môžu byť uložené v odlišných formátoch.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146874				0	sk	Formáty Obrazovej mapy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145153				0	sk	Obrazové mapy sú v podstate rozdelené na tie, ktoré sú analyzované na serveri (váš internetový poskytovateľ) a na tie, ktoré sú analyzované v internetovom prehliadači na počítači klienta.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152881				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>Server Side ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152881				0	sk	Obrazové mapy na strane servera				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153057				0	sk	Obrazové mapy vyhodnocované na strane servera sa zobrazuje pre čitateľa ako obrázok alebo rámec na stránke. Po kliknutí na obrázkovú mapu myšou sa relatívne súradnice odošlú na server. Pomocou špeciálneho programu server určí nasledujúci krok. Existuje niekoľko nekompatibilných metód na určenie tohto procesu. Dva najbežnejšie používané sú:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147502				0	sk	W3C (CERN) HTTP Server (Formát typu: MAP - CERN)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154011				0	sk	NCSA HTTP Server (Formát typu: MAP - NCSA)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149483	74			0	sk	$[officename] creates ImageMaps for both methods. Select the format from the \<emph\>File type \</emph\>list in the \<emph\>Save As \</emph\>dialog in the \<emph\>ImageMap Editor\</emph\>. Separate Map Files are created which you must upload to the server. You will need to ask your provider or network administrator which type of ImageMaps are supported by the server and how to access the evaluation program.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3152418				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>Client Side ImageMap\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152418				0	sk	Obrazová mapa na strane klienta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3151290				0	sk	The area of the picture or frame where the reader can click is indicated by the appearance of the linked \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#url\" name=\"URL\"\>URL\</link\> when the mouse passes over the area. The ImageMap is stored in a layer below the picture and contains information about the referenced regions. The only disadvantage of Client Side ImageMaps is that older Web browsers cannot read them; a disadvantage that will, however, resolve itself in time.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149664				0	sk	When saving the ImageMap, select the file type \<emph\>SIP - StarView ImageMap\</emph\>. This saves the ImageMap directly in a format which can be applied to every active picture or frame in your document. However, if you just want to use the ImageMap on the current picture or text frame, you do not have to save it in any special format. After defining the regions, simply click \<emph\>Apply\</emph\>. Nothing more is necessary. Client Side ImageMaps saved in \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> format are inserted directly into the page in HTML code.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159125				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>Java; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159125				0	sk	Java				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153188				0	sk	The Java programming language is a platform independent programming language that is especially suited for use in the Internet. Web pages and applications programmed with Java class files can be used on all modern operating systems. Programs using Java programming language are usually developed in a Java development environment and then compiled to a "byte code".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159153				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>plug-ins; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159153				0	sk	Zásuvný modul				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154127				0	sk	Rozšírenia poskytujúce doplnkové funkcie v webových prehliadačov sa označujú ako zásuvné moduly.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147484				0	sk	Zásuvný modul je termín používaný v rôznych kontextoch:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3168608				0	sk	Zásuvné moduly v $[officename]				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149910				0	sk	You will notice in $[officename] that the \<emph\>Formatting\</emph\> Bar changes after certain operations. For example, if you insert a formula into your text document, you see icons for editing the formula, in fact the same icons you see in formula documents. In this sense, we refer to the formula as a plug-in within the text document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148387				0	sk	Použitie zásuvných modulov rozšíri vaše programy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156737				0	sk	Zásuvné moduly, všeobecne povedané, sú softvérové rozšírenia k jednotlivým aplikáciám, ktoré poskytujú rozšírenie funkčnosti. Filtre importu a exportu pre rôzne formáty súboru sú často uložené ako zásuvné moduly v adresári zásuvných modulov.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149958				0	sk	Rozšírenia webového prehliadača Netscape vytvorené firmou Netscape Communication Corporationsa tiež nazývajú zásuvné moduly. Sú to externé programy prevažne z multimediálnych oblastí a spájajú sa s prehliadačom cez štandardné rozhrania. Tieto zásuvné moduly môžu byť prepojené s $[officename] dokumentom.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149420				0	sk	Any Netscape plug-ins (32 bit) installed on your system are automatically recognized by $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145647				0	sk	Proxy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	sk	Proxy je počítač v sieti vo funkcii istého druhu schránky pre presun dát. Vždy ak pristupujete k internetu zo spoločnej siete a požadujete webovú stránku, ktorá už bola načítaná spolupracovníkom, proxy bude schopný zobraziť stranu oveľa rýchlejšie, pokiaľ je stále v pamäti. Všetko, čo sa kontroluje v tomto prípade je iba to, či stránjka uložená v proxy je poslednej verzie. A to je prípad, kedy nie je potrebné stránku sťahovať z oveľa pomalšieho internetu, ale je možné ju načítať priamo z proxy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3154729				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>SGML; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	sk	SGML				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3147330				0	sk	SGML znamená "Standard Generalized Markup Language (Štandardný generalizovaný jazyk so značkami)". SGML je založený na myšlienke, že dokumenty majú štruktúrne a iné významové prvky, ktoré je možné zobraziť bez ohľadu na to, akým spôsobom sa majú zobraziť (ako majú vyzerať). Skutočný vzhľad takéhoto dokumentu sa môže meniť v závislosti na výstupnom médiu a preferenciách štýlu. V štruktúrovaných textoch SGML definuje nielen štruktúry (v DTD = Definícia typu dokumentu) ale aj zabezpečuje konzistentné použitie.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148747				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> is a specialized application of SGML. This means that most Web browsers support only a limited range of SGML standards and that almost all SGML-enabled systems can produce attractive HTML pages.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153950				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>search engines; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153950				0	sk	Vyhľadávač				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3157965				0	sk	Vyhľadávač je služba na internete založená na softvérovom programe používanom na preskúmanie rozsiahleho množstva informácií použitím kľúčových slov.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150751				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>tags; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150751				0	sk	Značky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156360				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000002.xhp#html\" name=\"HTML\"\>HTML\</link\> pages contain certain structural and formatting instructions called tags. Tags are code words enclosed by brackets in the document description language HTML. Many tags contain text or hyperlink references between the opening and closing brackets. For example, titles are marked by the tags <h1> at the beginning and </h1> at the end of the title. Some tags only appear on their own such as <br> for a line break or <img ...> to link a graphic.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3153766				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>URL; definition\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153766				0	sk	URL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3152931				0	sk	Uniform Resource Locator (URL) predstavuje adresu dokumentu alebo servera na internete. Hlavná štruktúra URL sa mení podľa typu a je obvykle v tvare služba://názovstroja:port/cesta/stránka#kotva aj keď nie všetky časti sú vždy vyžadované. URL môže byť FTP adresa, WWW (HTTP) adresa, adresa súboru alebo e-mailová adresa.				20200411 15:09:53
