helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000021.xhp	0	help	par_id3148919				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_DID_SAVE_PACKED_XML\"\>By default, $[officename] loads and saves files in the OpenDocument file format.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
