helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3156422				0	sk	Pika				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3144760				0	sk	pc				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3145322				0	sk	2				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3155131				0	sk	Bod				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3147288				0	sk	pt				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3145364				0	sk	1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	sk	The $[officename] Web page filter supports certain capabilities of CSS2. However, to use it, print layout export must be activated in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</emph\>. Then, in HTML documents, besides the HTML Page Style, you can also use the styles "First page", "Left page" and "Right page". These styles should enable you to set different page sizes and margins for the first page and for right and left pages when printing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	sk	Import a export čísel				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3145591				0	sk	If, in \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Load/Save - HTML Compatibility\</emph\>, the export option "$[officename] Writer" or "Internet Explorer" is selected, the indents of numberings are exported as "margin-left" CSS1 property in the STYLE attribute of the <OL> and <UL> tags. The property indicates the difference relative to the indent of the next higher level.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3153573				0	sk	Ľavé posunutie na ľavom okraji v číslovaní je indikované ako "ľavý okraj" vlastnosť CSS1. Prvý riadok indikácie je ignorovaný v číslovaní a nie je exportovaný.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148556				0	sk	Import a export súborov tabuľkového procesora				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3153365				0	sk	$[officename] import a export odkazy na zmazané časti, také ako napríklad, nejaký odkaz na kolónku. Celý vzorec môžeme vidieť v priebehu procesu exportu a zmazaný odkaz obsahuje indikáciu (#REF!) k odkazu. K #REF! bude vytvorený odpovedajúci odkaz v priebehu importu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150228				0	sk	Import a export grafických súborov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3152578				0	sk	Ako pri HTML dokumentoch, môžete si vybrať pre používanie filtre s alebo bez prvku ($[officename] Impress) v názve pre otváranie $[officename] grafivkých súborov. Ak vyberiete bez, súbor bude  otvorený ako $[officename] Draw dokument. Ináč, súbor uložený starou verziou programu je teraz otvorený v $[officename] Impress.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3144441				0	sk	When you import an EPS file, a preview of the graphic is displayed in the document. If a preview is not available, a placeholder corresponding to the size of the graphic is displayed in the document. Under Unix and Microsoft Windows you can print the imported file by using a PostScript printer. \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>If a different printer is used the preview will be printed.\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> When exporting EPS graphics, a preview is created and has the TIFF or EPSI format. If an EPS graphic together with other graphics is exported in the EPS format then this file will be embedded unchanged in the new file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3146120				0	sk	Viacstránkový TIFF je povolený, ak grafika je importovaná alebo exportovaná v TIFF formáte. Grafika je získaná ako súbor individuálnych obrázkov v jednoduchej rade, napríklad, individuálne stránky z faxu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3159153				0	sk	Some $[officename] Draw and $[officename] Impress options can be accessed through \<emph\>File - Export\</emph\>. See \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000200.xhp\" name=\"Graphics Export Options\"\>Graphics Export Options\</link\> for more information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153213				0	sk	Doplnok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	sk	Exportovať dokument alebo grafiku v doplnkovom formáte				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3163714				0	sk	Ak ste tak ešte neučinili, nainštalujte doplnkový radič tlačiarne, taký, ako Apple LaserWriter ovládač.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3153142				0	sk	Print the document with the \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\> menu command.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\00\00000020.xhp	0	help	par_id3154149				0	sk	Select the PostScript printer in the dialog and mark the \<emph\>Print to file\</emph\> check box. A PostScript file will be created.				20200411 15:09:53
