helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	par_id4653767				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>The files are exported as PNG files. PNG files are compressed without loss of data, and can contain more than 256 colors.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\autopi\01110300.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147618				0	sk	GIF -Výmenný grafický formát				20200411 15:09:53
