helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3152781				0	sk	Farba písma				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3154897				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3150503\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_fillstyle.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150503\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	bm_id3149795				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>paint can symbol\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3149795				0	sk	The following only applies to \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer: If you click the icon with a short-click while no text is selected, then the mouse pointer changes its appearance and is displayed as a paint can. Use this paint can symbol with the mouse key pressed to drag across a text area. This text area takes the selected color. The function remains active for as long as the icon is pressed, or until you click without dragging, or until you press the Escape key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3145120				0	sk	The following applies to all modules (\<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> Writer, Calc, Draw, Impress): Select the text that is to take another color, then click the color you want on the toolbar.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\text_color.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Font color\"\>Font color\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
