helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Changing the Title of a Document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	bm_id3156324				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>titles; changing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>changing;document titles\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>documents; changing titles\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156324				0	sk	\<variable id=\"change_title\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/change_title.xhp\" name=\"Changing the Title of a Document\"\>Changing the Title of a Document\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3152801				0	sk	You can specify a title for your document. Some file manager utilities can display the titles next to the filenames of your documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156136				0	sk	How to change the title of the current document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\change_title.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>File - Properties\</emph\>. This opens the \<emph\>Properties of\</emph\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
