helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3166410				0	sk	Under Windows only, you can view any $[officename] document in a window of the Microsoft Internet Explorer. Install the ActiveX control in the $[officename] Setup program.				20200411 15:09:53
