helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106CD				0	sk	Fontwork Same Letter Heights - changes the height of characters				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\fontwork.xhp	0	help	par_idN106D5				0	sk	Fontwork Alignment - aligns the text				20200411 15:09:53
