helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3156280				0	sk	Double-click one of the report names to open the report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_report.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	sk	These links are added automatically when you create a new report by the Report Wizard or in the Report Builder window.				20200411 15:09:53
