helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3152455				0	sk	F6: switches between object bar, table view, and selection area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3151180				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Up arrow or \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Down arrow: moves the border between table view and selection area up or down.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156288				0	sk	Keys in the Table View (upper area of the query design) and in the Relations window				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156166				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Arrow key: moves the selected table in the direction of the arrow.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3147310				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+Arrow key: resizes the selected table in the table view.				20200411 15:09:53
