helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\xsltfilter_create.xhp	0	help	par_idN10A32				0	sk	In the \<emph\>XSLT for export\</emph\> box, enter the path and file name of the XSLT stylesheet that defines the transformation from OpenDocument format to the external format.				20200411 15:09:53
