helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145136	1			0	sk	\<variable id=\"gallery_insert\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/gallery_insert.xhp\" name=\"Inserting Objects From the Gallery\"\>Inserting Objects From the Gallery\</link\> \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145345				0	sk	You can insert an object in a document either as a \<emph\>copy\</emph\> or as a \<emph\>link\</emph\>. A copy of an object is independent of the original object. Changes to the original object have no effect on the copy. A link remains dependent on the original object. Changes to the original object are also reflected in the link.				20200411 15:09:53
