helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\gallery_insert.xhp	0	help	par_id3145382				0	sk	Open the Gallery by clicking the \<emph\>Gallery\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Standard\</emph\> bar, or by selecting \<emph\>Tools - Gallery\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
