helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\find_attributes.xhp	0	help	par_id6837672				0	sk	Searching for attributes is available in the Find & Replace dialog for text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Nástroj pre oznamovanie chýb				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150616				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>Error Report Tool\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>reports;error reports\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>crash reports\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>activating;Error Report Tool\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150616				0	sk	\<variable id=\"error_report\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/guide/error_report.xhp\" name=\"Error Report Tool\"\>Error Report Tool\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3153345				0	sk	The Error Report Tool starts automatically when a program crash occurs.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147088				0	sk	The Error Report Tool gathers all necessary information that can help the program developers to improve the code, so that in later versions this error can possibly be avoided. Please help us to improve the software and send the generated error report.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148538				0	sk	Spúšťanie Nástroja pre oznamovanie chýb				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3149811				0	sk	With most program crashes the Error Report Tool will start automatically.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154046				0	sk	Doplnenie správy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3147335				0	sk	On the main Error Report Tool dialog, you can enter some additional information that may help the developers to localize the error. For example, if the error only appears after a change in your hardware or software environment, or if you clicked on a button, please include that information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159399				0	sk	Odosielanie správy o chybe				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3150504				0	sk	The Error Report Tool uses the HTTP PUT / SOAP protocol to send the report data. You may optionally enter some descriptive text that will help us to identify the context of the program crash. Then click the \<emph\>Send\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3149670				0	sk	You will not get an answer to your error report. If you need support, please visit the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\"\>support forum\</link\> on the Internet.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3153526				0	sk	You may choose to respond to questions that the developers may have about the reported error. Mark the check box if you allow to be contacted by e-mail, should additional information be required. By default this box is not marked, so you will not get any e-mail.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	sk	Aké dáta sú odosielané?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3154366				0	sk	The error report consists of several files. The main file contains information about the error type, operating system name and version, memory usage, and the description that you entered. You can click the \<emph\>Show Report\</emph\> button on the main dialog of the Error Report Tool to view what will get sent in the main file.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\error_report.xhp	0	help	par_id3151177				0	sk	In addition, relevant memory contents and stack traces are gathered by some system standard tools ("dbhhelp.dll" on Windows systems, "pstack" on UNIX systems). This information will be sent also.				20200411 15:09:53
