helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10743				0	sk	Contents that are stored on the clipboard can be pasted into your document using different formats. In %PRODUCTNAME you can choose how to paste the contents using a dialog or a drop-down icon.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10746				0	sk	The available options depend on the contents of the clipboard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144547360				0	sk	In Writer text documents, you can press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command+Option\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl+Alt\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+Shift+V to paste the contents of the clipboard as unformatted text.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10749				0	sk	Pasting clipboard contents using an icon menu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10750				0	sk	Click the arrow next to the \<emph\>Paste\</emph\> icon on the Standard Bar to open the menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10758				0	sk	Select one of the options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	sk	If you do not like the result, click the \<emph\>Undo\</emph\> icon and then paste again with another option.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10762				0	sk	Pasting clipboard contents using a dialog				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10769				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Paste special\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10771				0	sk	Select one of the options and click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN10774				0	sk	Pokiaľ ste v zošite a obsahom schránky sú bunky zošitu, zobrazí sa odlišný dialóg \<emph\>Vložiť inak\</emph\>. Pomocou dialógu \<emph\>Vložiť inak\</emph\> môžete skopírovať bunky s využitím základných alebo rozšírených možností.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\pasting.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077E				0	sk	\<emph\>Transpose\</emph\>: swaps the rows and the columns of the cell range to be pasted.				20200411 15:09:53
