helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149095				0	sk	Specifies the settings for importing and exporting Microsoft Office OLE objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3159233				0	sk	These settings are valid when no Microsoft OLE server exists (for example, in UNIX) or when there is no $[officename] OLE server ready for editing the OLE objects.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364795				0	sk	If an OLE server is active for the embedded object, then the OLE server will be used to handle the object.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id0107200910364725				0	sk	If no OLE server is active for MathType objects, then embedded MathType objects can be converted to %PRODUCTNAME Math objects. For this conversion, the embedded MathType objects must not exceed the MathType 3.1 specifications.				20200411 15:09:53
