helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01130200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154286				0	sk	Mark the box in the [L] column in front of the entry if a Microsoft OLE object is to be converted into the specified $[officename] OLE object when a Microsoft document is loaded into $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
