helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149667				0	sk	You can type and edit comments with the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/04050000.xhp\" name=\"Insert - Comment\"\>\<emph\>Insert - Comment\</emph\>\</link\> command. Comments that are permanently displayed can be edited by clicking the comment box. Click the Navigator and under the \<emph\>Comments\</emph\> entry you can view all comments in the current document. By double clicking a comment in Navigator, the cursor will jump to the corresponding cell containing the comment.				20200411 15:09:53
