helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01060400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149457				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCPAGE_USERLISTS:ED_COPYFROM\"\>Defines the spreadsheet and the cells to copy, in order to include them in the \<emph\>Lists\</emph\> box. The currently selected range in the spreadsheet is the default.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
