helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153365				0	sk	You also can use this function through the \<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"IMPRESS\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171400.xhp\" name=\"Icon\"\>icon\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<caseinline select=\"DRAW\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/02/01171400.xhp\" name=\"Icon\"\>icon\</link\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>icon\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> with the same name in the \<emph\>Options\</emph\> bar if a presentation or a drawing document is opened.				20200411 15:09:53
