helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153877				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SD_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTIONS_CONTENTS_CBX_HANDLES_BEZIER\"\>Displays the control points of all Bézier points if you have previously selected a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#bezierobjekt\" name=\"Bézier curve\"\>Bézier curve\</link\>. If the \<emph\>All control points in Bézier\</emph\> editor option is not marked, only the control points of the selected Bézier points will be visible.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
