helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200912315340				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/improvement.xhp\"\>Improvement Program\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200312315378				0	sk	The Improvement Program records some user interactions and sends them to the User Experience project.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594966				0	sk	The Improvement Program was initiated by the User Experience project to improve the usability of %PRODUCTNAME. The User Experience project can be found at the Apache OpenOffice website: \<link href=\"https://ux.openoffice.org/\"\>ux.openoffice.org/\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594946				0	sk	The second time you start your new %PRODUCTNAME software, you see a window that gives information about the Improvement Program. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094345				0	sk	At this time you can choose to accept or deny your participation.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id052620090409438				0	sk	If you accept, data recording starts immediately. When you start a new session of %PRODUCTNAME, the collected data will be sent. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200904094433				0	sk	If you deny to participate, no data will be sent and recording of data stops immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594945				0	sk	At any time, you can enable or disable the recording of user interaction data and the sending of these data. Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - Improvement Program\</item\>. Click the \<emph\>Info\</emph\> icon to browse to a web page with more information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903594944				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>Yes, I am willing to participate …\</emph\> to enable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595080				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click \<emph\>No, I do not wish to participate\</emph\> to disable the automatic feedback.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595037				0	sk	Tracked data				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595096				0	sk	The following data will be recorded and sent:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595033				0	sk	Clicks on toolbar buttons, including extension toolbars 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595014				0	sk	Execution of menu commands, including extension menus				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595145				0	sk	Clicks on context menu commands				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595115				0	sk	Fonts applied by using the menu 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595144				0	sk	Font sizes applied by using the menu 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595146				0	sk	Buttons, like OK, Cancel, etc. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595296				0	sk	Document language and paragraph language applied by using the menu or status bar 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595242				0	sk	Each recorded item also includes a time stamp and the module (Writer, Calc, Impress, …) where it has been called 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	hd_id0526200903595229				0	sk	The following data will not be recorded and sent:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595234				0	sk	User names and passwords 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595218				0	sk	Any type of document content 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\improvement.xhp	0	help	par_id0526200903595213				0	sk	Paths, filenames 				20200411 15:09:53
