helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	sk	Zalomenia				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150874				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_CHECKBOX_TP_OPTSHDWCRSR_CB_BREAK\"\>Displays all line breaks inserted with the Shift+Enter shortcut. These breaks create a new line, but do not start a new paragraph.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
