helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147530				0	sk	Grafická vyrovnávacia pamäť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01011000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	sk	The graphics cache saves the graphics contained in a document in your computer's main memory. This means that the attributes of a graphic stored in the cache do not have to be re-calculated if you return to the page containing the graphic after scrolling through a document.				20200411 15:09:53
