helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_id8599810				0	sk	If enabled, Writer adds spacing between words, in lines that end with Shift+Enter in justified paragraphs. If disabled, spacing between words will not be expanded to justify the lines.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01041000.xhp	0	help	par_id8012634				0	sk	This setting is on by default for .odt text documents. It will be saved and loaded with the document in the .odt text document format. This setting cannot be saved in old .sxw text documents, so this setting is off for .sxw text documents.				20200411 15:09:53
