helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8754844				0	sk	Specifies some options for the automatic notification and downloading of online updates to %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	hd_id2189397				0	sk	Check for updates automatically				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id7523728				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Mark to check for online updates periodically, then select the time interval how often %PRODUCTNAME will check for online updates.\</ahelp\> %PRODUCTNAME will check once a day, week, or month, as soon as a working Internet connection is detected. If you connect to the Internet by a proxy server, set the proxy on \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8994109				0	sk	When an update is available, an icon in the menu bar displays some explaining text. Click the icon to proceed.				20200411 15:09:53
