helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	sk	Prípona				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3153970				0	sk	The search terms are passed between the prefix and the suffix.\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_POSTFIX\"\>The suffix provides the command sequence, sent at the end of a search.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
