helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3150870				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX:EDIT:RID_SVXPAGE_INET_SEARCH:ED_SEPARATOR\"\>If you type more than one word while running a search, these words will be separated by the character specified here.\</ahelp\> Most search engines require the "+" character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3149560				0	sk	To determine which prefixes, separators and suffixes to use when defining a new search engine:				20200411 15:09:53
