helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3147434				0	sk	Copy the URL from your browser's \<emph\>URL\</emph\> field and paste it into a blank document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01020200.xhp	0	help	par_id3148647				0	sk	Change the conditions for the search in the search engine, if it offers you the choice.				20200411 15:09:53
