helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153823				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01040700.xhp\" name=\"Changes\"\>Changes\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149416				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_REDLINE_OPT\"\>Defines the appearance of changes in the document.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3156153				0	sk	To record or show changes in your text or spreadsheet document, choose \<link href=\"text/shared/01/02230000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Changes\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Changes - Record\</emph\>\</link\> or \<emph\>Edit - Changes - Show\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155419				0	sk	Zobraziť text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3144510				0	sk	Defines the settings for displaying recorded changes. Select the type of change and the corresponding display attribute and color. The preview field shows the effect of the selected display options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148550				0	sk	Insertions / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154758				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_INS_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is inserted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152812				0	sk	Deletions / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154365				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_DEL_ATTR\"\>Specifies how changes in the document are displayed when text is deleted. If you record text deletions, the text is displayed with the selected attribute (for example, strikethrough) and is not deleted.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148674				0	sk	Changed attributes / Attributes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3151042				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_ATTR\"\>Defines how changes to text attributes are displayed in the document. These changes affect attributes such as bold, italic or underline.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153105				0	sk	Farba				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3145419				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_LISTBOX_TP_REDLINE_OPT_LB_CHG_COL\"\>You can also choose a color to display each type of recorded change. When you choose the condition "By author" in the list, the color is automatically determined by $[officename], then modified to match to the author of each change.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145607				0	sk	Zmenených riadkov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3149562				0	sk	To indicate which lines of the text have been changed, you can define a mark that appears in the left or right page margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145785				0	sk	Označiť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3154638				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_MARKPOS\"\>Defines if and where changed lines in the document are marked.\</ahelp\> You can set the markings so that they always appear on the left or right page margin, or on the outer or inner margin.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163713				0	sk	Farba				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01040700.xhp	0	help	par_id3146975				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_REDLINE_OPT:LB_LC_COL\"\>Specifies the color for highlighting the changed lines in the text.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Možnosti tlače				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	bm_id3147323				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>printing; colors in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>grayscale printing\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>colors; printing in grayscale\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>printing; warnings\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>paper size warning\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148946				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010900.xhp\" name=\"Print Options\"\>Print Options\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150359				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies the print setting options.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148451				0	sk	Redukovať dáta k tlači				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154910				0	sk	You can reduce the amount of data to be sent to the printer. Reducing the print data increases the print speed because the print files are smaller. This makes it easier for printers with a smaller memory to print. Reducing print data can result in slightly lower print quality.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147085				0	sk	Nastavenie pre				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3158407				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_PRINTFILEOUTPUT\"\>Specifies whether the print settings apply to direct printing or to printing to a file.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145786				0	sk	Reduce transparency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3159154				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY\"\>If you mark this field the transparent objects will be printed like normal, non-transparent objects, depending on your selection in the following two option buttons.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156444				0	sk	Transparency cannot be output directly to a printer. The areas of the document in which transparency is to be visible must therefore always be calculated as bitmaps and sent to the printer. Depending on the size of the bitmaps and the print resolution a large amount of data may result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147441				0	sk	Automaticky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150488				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_AUTO\"\>Specifies that the transparency is only printed if the transparent area covers less than a quarter of the entire page.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149417				0	sk	Neprehľadné				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153878				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCETRANSPARENCY_NONE\"\>With this option transparency is never printed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149960				0	sk	Reduce bitmaps				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148455				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS\"\>Specifies that bitmaps are printed with reduced quality. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149400				0	sk	High/normal print quality				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154510	76			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEBITMAPS_NORMAL\"\>High print quality corresponds to a resolution of 300dpi. Normal print quality corresponds to a resolution of 200dpi. \</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146969				0	sk	Rozlíšenie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154270				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_LISTBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_LB_REDUCEBITMAPS_RESOLUTION\"\>Specifies the maximum print quality in dpi. The resolution can only be reduced and not increased.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146789				0	sk	Include transparent objects				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150749				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEBITMAPS_TRANSPARENCY\"\>If this field is marked, the reduction in print quality for bitmaps also applies to the transparent areas of objects.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154362				0	sk	Reduce gradients				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3148914				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_REDUCEGRADIENTS\"\>If this field is marked, gradients are printed with reduced quality.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155766				0	sk	Gradient stripes				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_NUMERICFIELD_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_NF_REDUCEGRADIENTS_STEPCOUNT\"\>Specifies the maximum number of gradient stripes for printing.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146313				0	sk	Intermediate color				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145230				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_RADIOBUTTON_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_RB_REDUCEGRADIENTS_COLOR\"\>Specifies that gradients are only printed in a single intermediate color.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147323				0	sk	Convert colors to grayscale				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3145150				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_CONVERTTOGREYSCALES\"\>Specifies that all colors are printed only as grayscale.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150646				0	sk	Hlásenia tlačiarne				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3154022				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_CONVERTTOGREYSCALES\"\>Defines which warnings appear before printing begins.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147003				0	sk	Veľkosť papiera				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3150206				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_PAPERSIZE\"\>Mark this check box if a certain paper size is needed for printing the current document.\</ahelp\> If the paper size used in the document is not provided by the current printer, you will receive an error message.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155581				0	sk	Orientácia papiera				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3153231				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_PAPERORIENTATION\"\>Mark this check box if you need a certain paper orientation for printing the current document.\</ahelp\> If the format used by the current document is not available from the printer, an error message will appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149531				0	sk	Transparency				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010900.xhp	0	help	par_id3152778				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SFX2_CHECKBOX_TP_COMMONPRINTOPTIONS_CB_TRANSPARENCY\"\>Mark this check box if you always want to be warned if transparent objects are contained in the document.\</ahelp\> If you print such a document, a dialog appears in which you can select if the transparency is to be printed in this print instruction.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Prístupnosť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3159411				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>disabled persons\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>text colors for better accessibility\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>animations; accessibility options\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>Help tips; hiding\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>high contrast mode\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>accessibility; options\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>options; accessibility\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159411				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01013000.xhp\" name=\"Accessibility\"\>Accessibility\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Sets options that make \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> programs more accessible for users with reduced sight, limited dexterity or other disabilities.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3166460				0	sk	Rôzne možnosti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152996				0	sk	Sets accessibility options.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154750				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Support assistive technology tools (program restart required)\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155628				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"UNIX\"\>\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ACCESSIBILITY_TOOL\"\>Allows you to use assistive tools, such as external screen readers, Braille devices or speech recognition input devices. The Java Runtime Environment must be installed on your computer before you can enable assistive support.\</ahelp\>\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154047				0	sk	Use text selection cursor in read-only text document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149164				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_TEXTSELECTION\"\>Displays cursor in read-only documents.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147531				0	sk	Allow animated graphics				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ANIMATED_GRAPHICS\"\>Previews animated graphics, such as GIF images, in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147264				0	sk	Allow animated text				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149656				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_ANIMATED_TEXTS\"\>Previews animated text, such as blinking and scrolling, in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153381				0	sk	Help tips disappear after				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_TIPHELP\"\>Hides the \<link href=\"text/shared/main0108.xhp\" name=\"Help tips\"\>Help tips\</link\> after the number of seconds that you enter.\</ahelp\> Otherwise, Help tips are displayed until you press Escape or move the cursor.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151043				0	sk	Sekundy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148672				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_NUMERICFIELD_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_NF_TIPHELP\"\>Enter the number of seconds to display the Help tips.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149809				0	sk	Možnosti pre zobrazenie vo vysokom kontraste				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153106				0	sk	High contrast is an operating system setting that changes the system color scheme to improve readability. You can decide how \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> uses the high contrast settings of the operating system.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3125863				0	sk	Cell borders and shadows are always shown in text color when high contrast mode is active. The cell background color is ignored then.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3155132				0	sk	Automatically detect high contrast mode of operating system				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153768				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTO_DETECT_HC\"\>Switches \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> into high contrast mode when the system background color is very dark.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154918				0	sk	Use automatic font color for screen display				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01013000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146984				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SVX_CHECKBOX_RID_SVXPAGE_ACCESSIBILITYCONFIG_CB_AUTOMATIC_FONT_COLOR\"\>Displays fonts in \<item type=\"productname\"\>%PRODUCTNAME\</item\> using the system color settings. This option only affects the screen display.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
