helpcontent2	source\text\shared\optionen\01010200.xhp	0	help	par_id5684987				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If enabled, the printer settings will be loaded with the document. This can cause a document to be printed on a distant printer, if you do not change the printer manually in the Print dialog. If disabled, your standard printer will be used to print this document. The current printer settings will be stored with the document whether or not this option is checked.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
