helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149150				0	sk	You cannot use the data source browser on a database table that is open in Design view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149235				0	sk	Data source browser				20200411 15:09:53
