helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149514				0	sk	To select a record in a database table, click the row header, or click a row header, and then use the Up or Down arrow keys.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340400.xhp	0	help	par_id7812433001				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Select database records. Drag-and-drop rows or cells to the document to insert contents. Drag-and-drop column headers to insert fields.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
