helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\02250000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156423				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a short name for the record. The short name appears in the \<emph\>Identifier\</emph\> column in the list of records.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
