helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\moviesound.xhp	0	help	par_idN10683				0	sk	To insert a movie or sound file into your document				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\moviesound.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068A				0	sk	Click where you want to insert the file.				20200411 15:09:53
