helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\06040100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154162				0	sk	\<switchinline select=\"appl\"\>\<caseinline select=\"WRITER\"\>Combines consecutive single-line paragraphs into a single paragraph. This option only works on paragraphs that use the "Default" paragraph style. If a paragraph is longer than the specified length value, the paragraph is combined with the next paragraph. To enter a different length value, select the option, and then click \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/05150104.xhp\"\>\<emph\>Edit\</emph\>\</link\>.\</caseinline\>\</switchinline\>				20200411 15:09:53
