helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\xformsdatatab.xhp	0	help	par_id2318796				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Specifies a regular expression pattern. Strings validated against the data type must conform to this pattern to be valid. The XSD data type syntax for regular expressions is different from the regular expression syntax used elseswhere in %PRODUCTNAME, for example in the Find & Replace dialog.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
