helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5084688				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click the \<emph\>Check for Updates\</emph\> button in the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Extension Manager\</link\> to check for online updates for all installed extensions. To check for online updates for only the selected extension, right-click to open the context menu, then choose \<emph\>Update\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6401257				0	sk	When you click the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Check for Updates\</item\> button or choose the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Update\</item\> command, the Extension Update dialog is displayed and the check for availability of updates starts immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5841242				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>While checking for updates, you see a progress indicator. Wait for some messages to show up in the dialog, or click Cancel to abort the update check.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6794030				0	sk	If no updates are available, the message in the dialog tells you there are no updates. Close the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id7096774				0	sk	If updates are available, the updates can either be installed automatically, or you must respond with some action:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6420484				0	sk	The Extension Update dialog may contain entries which are not selectable and hence no automatic update can be performed. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6986602				0	sk	Dependencies are not fulfilled (the update needs some more or newer files to be installed).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id616779				0	sk	Insufficient user rights (the Extension Manager was started from the menu, but shared extensions can only be modified when %PRODUCTNAME does not run, and only by a user with appropriate rights). See \<link href=\"text/shared/01/packagemanager.xhp\"\>Extension Manager\</link\> for details.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id791039				0	sk	A manual update is necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id757469				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>When you click the Install button the Download and Installation dialog is displayed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id5189062				0	sk	All extensions which can be directly downloaded are downloaded now. The progress is shown in the Download and Installation dialog. If an extension cannot be downloaded, a message is displayed. The operation continues for the remaining extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id3949095				0	sk	Some extensions may be marked with the phrase "browser based update". These extensions cannot be downloaded by the Extension Manager. A web browser must be opened to download the extension update from a particular web site. That site may require several more user interaction to download the extension. After downloading you must install the extension manually, for example by double-clicking the extension's icon in a file browser.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id3729056				0	sk	For extensions marked as "browser based update", the Extension Manager will open your web browser on the respective web site. This happens when you close the dialog, after downloading any other extension updates. If there are no extensions which can be directly downloaded then the web browser is started immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id6854457				0	sk	After the last extension has been downloaded, the installation begins. First all installed extensions for which an update could be downloaded successfully, are removed. Then the updated extensions are installed. If an error occurs, a message that the installation failed is displayed, but the operation proceeds.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id3372295				0	sk	If all updates have been processed the Download and Installation dialog shows that it has finished. You can abort the download and installation process by clicking the \<emph\>Abort Update\</emph\> button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	hd_id5699942				0	sk	Show all Updates				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\extensionupdate.xhp	0	help	par_id641193				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>By default, only the down-loadable extensions are shown in the dialog. Mark \<emph\>Show all Updates\</emph\> to see also other extensions and error messages.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
