helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05240100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149741				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:MirrorVert\"\>Flips the selected object(s) vertically from top to bottom.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
