helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05340600.xhp	0	help	par_id3147212	2			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays hidden columns. Choose the column that you want to display from the list, or click \<emph\>All \</emph\>to display all of the hidden columns.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
