helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154689				0	sk	\<variable id=\"gruppierentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FormatGroup\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Groups the selected objects, so that they can be moved as a single object.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05290100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150008				0	sk	The properties of individual objects are maintained even after you group the objects. You can nest groups, that is, you can have a group within a group.				20200411 15:09:53
