helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\05030500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148643				0	sk	If you are in a table or spreadsheet, you can also add or remove predefined borders. Use the \<emph\>Borders\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Table Bar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
