helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\03010000.xhp	0	help	par_id2355113				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>In book mode view layout you see two pages side by side as in an open book. The first page is a right page with an odd page number.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
