helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	bm_id7647328				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>updates;checking manually\</bookmark_value\>      \<bookmark_value\>online updates;checking manually\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	hd_id315256				0	sk	\<variable id=\"online_update\"\>\<link href=\"text/shared/01/online_update.xhp\"\>Check for Updates\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3174230				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Mark to enable the automatic check for updates. Choose %PRODUCTNAME - Online Update in the Options dialog box to disable or enable this feature.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id0116200901063996				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click to select a folder to download the files.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6797082				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>You can check for updates manually or automatically.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4218878				0	sk	Checking for updates will also look for updates of all installed extensions.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id8132267				0	sk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Help - Check for Updates\</item\> to check manually.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id702230				0	sk	You can disable or enable the automatic check in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME - \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/online_update.xhp\"\>Online Update\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3422345				0	sk	If an update is available, an icon\<image id=\"img_id3155415\" src=\"extensions/source/update/ui/onlineupdate_16.png\" width=\"0.4583in\" height=\"0.1354in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3155415\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> on the menu bar will notify you of the update. Click the icon to open a dialog with more information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9313638				0	sk	You will see the \<link href=\"text/shared/01/online_update_dialog.xhp\"\>Check for Updates\</link\> dialog with some information about the online update of %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id9951780				0	sk	Enable an Internet connection for %PRODUCTNAME.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id6479384				0	sk	If you need a proxy server, enter the proxy settings in \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - Internet - Proxy.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3639027				0	sk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Check for Updates\</item\> to check for the availability of a newer version of your office suite.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id3722342				0	sk	If a newer version is available and %PRODUCTNAME is not set up for automatic downloading, then you can select any of the following actions:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id5106662				0	sk	Download the new version.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update.xhp	0	help	par_id4931485				0	sk	Install the downloaded files.				20200411 15:09:53
