helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\ref_pdf_export.xhp	0	help	par_id0901200811454970				0	sk	Select the format of the data that you will receive from the submitter: FDF (Forms Data Format), PDF, HTML, or XML.				20200411 15:09:53
