helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\rep_prop.xhp	0	help	par_id6993926				0	sk	The \<emph\>General\</emph\> tab page can be used to change the name of the report, and to disable the Page Header or Page Footer areas, among others.				20200411 15:09:53
