helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154536				0	sk	Sčíta všetky hodnoty pridružených polí.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148820				0	sk	Zoskupiť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145375				0	sk	Zoskupiť podľa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149438				0	sk	Zoskúpi dáta dotazu podľa daného poľa. Funkcia sa spúšťa podľa určených skupín. V SQL táto voľba zodpovedá klauzule GROUP BY. Ak pridáte kritérium, zobrazí sa toto pole v SQL HAVING.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156038				0	sk	Funkcie môžete zadať aj priamo do SQL dotazu. Syntax je:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156340				0	sk	SELECT FUNKCIA(stĺpec) FROM tabulka.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155075				0	sk	Funkciu pre výpočet súčtov je napríklad možné volať vo výraze SQL nasledujúcím spôsobom:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154591				0	sk	SELECT SUM("Cena") FROM "Výrobok".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3159205				0	sk	Except for the \<emph\>Group\</emph\> function, the above functions are so-called Aggregate functions. These are functions that calculate data to create summaries from the results. Additional functions that are not listed in the list box might be also possible. These depend on the specific database system in use and on the current state of the Base driver.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148651				0	sk	To use other functions not listed in the list box, you must enter them under \<emph\>Field\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155098				0	sk	You can also assign aliases to function calls. If the query is not to be displayed in the column header, enter the desired name under \<emph\>Alias\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155539				0	sk	Zodpovedajúca funkcia v príkaze SQL je:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149425				0	sk	SELECT FUNCTION() AS alias FROM tabuľka				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144431				0	sk	Príklad:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154614				0	sk	SELECT COUNT(*) AS počet FROM "Položka".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154610				0	sk	Ak spustítei túto funkciu, nemôžete už vložiť do dotazu ďalšie stĺpce inak, ako získať tieto stĺpce ako funkciu "Group" .				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154644				0	sk	\<emph\>Examples\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151120				0	sk	V následujúcom príklade je dotaz spustený nad dvoma tabuľkami: tabuľkou "Položka" s poľom "Položka_č" a tabuľkou "Dodávatelia" s poľom "Názov_dodávateľa". Obe tabuľky majú naviac spoločný názov poľa "Dodávateľ_č."				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155144				0	sk	Na vytvorenie dotazu obsahujúceho všetkých dodávateľov, ktorí dodávajú viac ako tri položky, je nutné vykonať kroky uvedené ďalej.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153240				0	sk	Do návrhu dotazu vložte tabuľky "Položka" a "Dodávatelia".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148807				0	sk	Spojte polia "Dodávateľ_č" oboch tabuliek, ak doteraz vzťah tohoto typu neexistuje.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3161652				0	sk	Double-click the "Item_No" field from the "Item" table. Display the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> line using the context menu and select the Count function.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151009				0	sk	Zadajte hodnotu >3 ako kritérium a zrušte zaškrtnutie políčka v poli Viditeľné.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145601				0	sk	V tabuľce "Dodávatelia" poklopte na pole "Názov_dodávateľa" a vyberte funkciu Zoskupiť.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147512				0	sk	Run the query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148638				0	sk	Ak existuje v tabuľke Položka pole "cena" (ako jednotlivá cena výrobku) a pole "Dodávateľ_č" (ako dodávateľ daného výrobku), potom můžete zadaním nasledujúceho dotazu obdržať priemernú cenu za položku dodávanú dodávateľom:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153045				0	sk	Do návrhu dotazu vložte tabuľku "Položka".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149802				0	sk	Poklopte na polia "Cena" a "Dodávateľ_č".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153554				0	sk	Enable the \<emph\>Function\</emph\> line and select the Average function from the "Price" field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155597				0	sk	Môžete zadat aj text "Priemer" do riadku pre zástupný názov (alias).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151191				0	sk	Pre pole "Dodávateľ_č" vyberte funkciu Zoskupenie - Group.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155547				0	sk	Run the query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147549				0	sk	K dispozícii sú nasledujúce príkazy a symboly miestnej ponuky:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154172				0	sk	Funkcie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150414				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides a row for selection of functions.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149872				0	sk	Názov tabuľky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147246				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides the row for the table name.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145117				0	sk	Alias				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155754				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Shows or hides the row for the alias name.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153298				0	sk	Jedinečné hodnoty				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147500				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>Applies only distinct values to the query.\</ahelp\> This applies to records containing data that appears several times in the selected fields. If the \<emph\>Distinct Values\</emph\> command is active, you will see only one record in the query (DISTINCT). Otherwise, you will see all records corresponding to the query criteria (ALL).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150436	159			0	sk	For example, if the name "Smith" occurs several times in your address database, you can choose the\<emph\> Distinct Values\</emph\> command to specify in the query that the name "Smith" will occur only once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152352	160			0	sk	For a query involving several fields, the combination of values from all fields must be unique so that the result can be formed from a specific record. For example, you have "Smith in Chicago" once in your address book and "Smith in London" twice. With the\<emph\> Distinct Values\</emph\> command, the query will use the two fields "last name" and "city" and return the query result "Smith in Chicago" once and "Smith in London" once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149825				0	sk	V SQL zodpovedá tento príkaz predikátu DISTINCT.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148926				0	sk	Formulovanie filtračných podmienok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153162				0	sk	Pri vytváraní filtrovacích podmienok máte k dispozícii rôzné operátory a pííkazy. Okrem relačních operátorov sú k dispozícii aj príkazy špecifické pre SQL, ktoré kontrolujú obsah databázových polí. Ak použijete príkazy v syntaxi $[officename], automaticky ich $[officename] prevedie na zodpovedajúcu syntax SQL. Môžete tiež primo zadať SQL príkaz. Následujúca tabuľka vám poskytuje prehľad operátorov a príkazov:				20200411 15:09:53
