helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157888				0	sk	Tato syntax závisí na použitom databázovom systéme. Poznámka: polia Áno/Nie sa môžu chovať rôzne (môžu získavať dva stavy namiesto troch).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145772				0	sk	Parametrické dotazy				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157312				0	sk	Promennú musíte vložiť do hranatých zátvoriek (=[x]), ak chcete vytvorit dotaz s parametrickou premennou. Prípadne tiež môžete použíť znak rovnosti nasledovaný dvojbodkou (=:x). Pri spustení dotazu zobrazí program dialóg, do ktorého zadáte výraz, ktorý sa priradí premennej x.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150818				0	sk	Ak dotaz obsahuje viacero parametrov, zobrazí sa zoznam so všetkými parametrami a u každého riadok pre zadanie. Zadajte hodnoty (nejlépe zhora dole) a stlačte po každom riadku Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157855				0	sk	Parametrické dotazy so zástupnými znakmi (*,_) alebo zvláštnymi znakmi (napr. ?) nie sú možné.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3157537				0	sk	Ak vytvoríte parametrický dotaz a uložíte ho s premennými, môžete neskôr vytvoriť dotaz, v ktorom iba nahradíte premenné požadovanými výrazmi. Pri otvorení dotazu $[officename] zobrazí dialóg pre zadanie týchto premenných.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151035				0	sk	Vstup parametra				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153596				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_QRYDGN_ROW_FUNCTION\"\>The \<emph\>Parameter Input\</emph\> dialog asks you which variables you defined in the query. Enter a value for each query variable and confirm by clicking \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150585				0	sk	Parameter queries are also used for \<link href=\"text/shared/02/01170203.xhp\" name=\"subforms\"\>subforms\</link\>, since they work exclusively with queries for which the values to be invoked are read internally from a variable.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153645				0	sk	V príkaze SQL môže mať parametrický dotaz nasledujúci tvar:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3156731				0	sk	select * from 'addresses' where 'name' = :placeholder				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145181				0	sk	Režim SQL				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147013				0	sk	SQL čiže Structured Query Language je jazyk, ktorý popisuje príkazy slúžiace na aktualizáciu a správu relačných databáz.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152570	136			0	sk	In $[officename] you do not need any knowledge of SQL for most queries, since you do not have to enter the SQL code. If you create a query in the query design, $[officename] automatically converts your instructions into the corresponding SQL syntax. If, with the help of the \<emph\>Switch Design View On/Off \</emph\>button, you change to the SQL view, you can see the SQL commands for a query that has been created previously.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3152412				0	sk	Dotaz môžete tiež zadať priamo v SQL. Podrobná syntax ale závisí na použitom databázovom systéme.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146842				0	sk	If you enter the SQL code manually, you can create SQL-specific queries that are not supported by the graphical interface in \<emph\>Query design\</emph\>. These queries must be executed in native SQL mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149632				0	sk	By clicking the \<link href=\"text/shared/02/14030000.xhp\" name=\"Run SQL command directly\"\>\<emph\>Run SQL command directly\</emph\>\</link\> icon in the SQL view, you can formulate a query that is not processed by $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
