helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150445				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>dotazy; chýbajúce prvky (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150445				0	sk	Missing Element				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150247	2			0	sk	If a query in which tables or fields no longer exist is opened, the\<emph\> Missing Element \</emph\>dialog appears. This dialog names the missing table or the field which cannot be interpreted and allows you to decide how to continue with the procedure.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145072				0	sk	Ako pokračovať?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149177				0	sk	Na túto otázku existujú tri odpovede:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147576				0	sk	Určite chcete otvoriť dotaz v grafickom zobrazení?				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3166461				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to open the query in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"Design View\"\>Design View\</link\> in spite of missing elements.\</ahelp\> This option also allows you to specify if other errors need to be ignored.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153031				0	sk	Dotaz je otvorený v návrhovom pohľade (grafický pohľad). Chýbajúce tabuľky sú prázdne a neplatné polia sa objavia s ich (neplatnými názvami) v zozname polí. To umožňuje pracovať presne s tými poľami, ktoré spôsobili chybu. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149578				0	sk	Otvoriť dotaz v zobrazení SQL.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159157				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to open the query design in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02010100.xhp\" name=\"SQL Mode\"\>SQL Mode\</link\> and to interpret the query as a \<link href=\"text/shared/02/14030000.xhp\" name=\"Native SQL\"\>Native SQL\</link\>.\</ahelp\> You can only quit the native SQL mode when the $[officename] statement is completely interpreted (only possible if the used tables or fields in the query really exist).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150984				0	sk	Neotvárať dotaz				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156329				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Allows you to cancel the procedure and specify that the query should not be opened.\</ahelp\> This option corresponds to the function of the \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> dialog button.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148492				0	sk	Ignorovať aj podobné chyby				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154285				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>If you selected the first option, but you still want to open the query in the graphics view in spite of missing elements, you can specify whether other errors are ignored.\</ahelp\> Therefore, in the current opening process, no error message will be displayed if the query can not be correctly interpreted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Relácie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153323				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05020000.xhp\" name=\"Relations\"\>Relations\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3146957				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>relačná databáza (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3146957	2			0	sk	This command opens the \<emph\>Relation Design \</emph\>window, which allows you to define relationships between various database tables.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154823				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_CTL_RELATIONTAB\"\>Here you can link together tables from the current database through common data fields.\</ahelp\> Click the \<emph\>New Relation\</emph\> icon to create the relationships, or simply drag-and-drop with the mouse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145316				0	sk	Táto funkcia je dostupná len ak pracujete s relačnou databázou.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149235				0	sk	When you choose \<emph\>Tools - Relationships\</emph\>, a window opens in which all the existing relationships between the tables of the current database are shown. If no relationships have been defined, or if you want to relate other tables of the database to each other, then click the \<emph\>Add Tables\</emph\> icon. The \<link href=\"text/shared/02/14020100.xhp\" name=\"Add Tables\"\>Add Tables\</link\> dialog opens in which you can select the tables that you want.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152812				0	sk	If the \<emph\>Relation Design\</emph\> window is open, the selected tables cannot be modified, even in Table Design mode. This ensures that tables are not changed while the relations are being created.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150541				0	sk	Vybrané tabuľky sa zobrazia v hornej časti okna návrhu. Okno tabuľky môžete zatvoriť pomocou miestnej ponuky alebo klávesou Delete.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3148922				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>primárne kľúče; vkladanie (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>kľúče; primárne kľúče (Base)\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>externé kľúče (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148922				0	sk	Primárny kľúč a iný kľúč				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149168				0	sk	If you want to define a relation among the different tables, you should enter a \<link href=\"text/shared/00/00000005.xhp#primaerschluessel\" name=\"primary key\"\>primary key\</link\> that clearly identifies a data field of the existing table. You can refer to the primary key from other tables to access the data of this table. All data fields referring to this primary key will be identified as an external key.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147085				0	sk	Všetky dátové polia odkazujúce na primárny kľúč budú označené v okne tabuliek malým symbolom kľúča.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153193				0	sk	Definovanie relácií				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	bm_id3155430				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>relácie; vytváranie a mazanie (Base)\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155430				0	sk	Všetky existujúce relácie sú zobrazené v okne relácií ako čiara spojujúca primárne a externé kľúče. Reláciu môžete pridať, keď pretiahnete pole z jednej tabuľky na pole inej tabuľky. Reláciu odstránite, keď ju vyberiete a stlačíte Delete.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149984				0	sk	Alternatively, you can also click the \<emph\>New Relation\</emph\> icon in the top area of the relation field and define the relation between two tables in the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/05020100.xhp\" name=\"Relations\"\>\<emph\>Relations\</emph\>\</link\> dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153093				0	sk	Ak používáte $[officename] ako rozhranie k relačnej databáze, neukladá sa vytvorenie a zmazanie relácií do dočasnej pamäte, ale posiela sa priamo externej databáze.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\05020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155856	15			0	sk	By double-clicking a connection line, you can assign certain properties to the relation. The \<emph\>Relations \</emph\>dialog opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\tablewizard00.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Sprievodca tabuľkou				20200411 15:09:53
