helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150445				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/02000000.xhp\" name=\"Queries\"\>Queries\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150499				0	sk	A "query" is a special view of a table. A query can display chosen records or chosen fields within records; it can also sort those records. A query can apply to one table to multiple tables, if they are linked by common data fields.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147399				0	sk	Use queries to find records from data tables based on certain criteria. All queries created for a database are listed under the \<emph\>Queries\</emph\> entry. Since this entry contains the database queries, it is also called the "query container".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153750				0	sk	Tlač dotazov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149183				0	sk	Tlač dotazov alebo tabuliek				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3156426				0	sk	Otvorte textový dokument (alebo zošit ak preferujete jeho špecifické funkcie pre tlač).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149827				0	sk	Open the database file and click the Table icon if you want to print a table, or click the Query icon if you want to print a query.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149398				0	sk	Drag the name of the table or query into the open text document or spreadsheet. The dialog \<link href=\"text/shared/02/12070000.xhp\" name=\"Insert Database Columns\"\>Insert Database Columns\</link\> opens.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150443				0	sk	Decide which columns = data fields you want to include. You can also click the \<emph\>AutoFormat\</emph\> button and select a corresponding formatting type. Close the dialog.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153561				0	sk	Dotaz alebo tabuľka budú vložené do vášho dokumentu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150503				0	sk	Print the document by choosing \<emph\>File - Print\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\02000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153146				0	sk	You can also open the data source view (F4), select the entire database table in the data source view (button in the top left corner of the table), and then drag the selection to a text document or spreadsheet.				20200411 15:09:53
