helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3479720				0	sk	The Adabas D software package can be downloaded and installed separately (see www.adabas.com).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152997				0	sk	O databáze Adabas				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151111				0	sk	The free available Adabas database is restricted to a size of 100 MB, and a maximum of three users on a network. See the "License.txt" file in the Adabas directory for more details. The Adabas database must be installed in a separate directory from $[officename].				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154749				0	sk	Název súborov Adabas nesmie prekročiť dĺžku 8 znakov. Cesta k súboru Adabas, včítane názvu súboru, nesmie prekročiť dĺžku 30 znakov a musí byť v 7 bitovom kóde ASCII. Cesta ani názov súboru nesmú obsahovať medzery.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153254				0	sk	Vo Windows pridá inštalátor Adabas premennú prostredia DBROOT, ktorá obsahuje cestu k databáze. Ak inštalátor nájde túto premennú, databázu nenainšataluje.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154729				0	sk	Create New Adabas Database				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149378				0	sk	Use the \<link href=\"text/shared/explorer/database/30100000.xhp\" name=\"Create New Adabas Database\"\>\<emph\>Create New Adabas Database\</emph\>\</link\> dialog to create an Adabas database:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147045				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>File - New - Database\</emph\> to open the Database Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3147394				0	sk	Click \<emph\>Connect to an existing database\</emph\>, and then select "Adabas" in the listbox (scroll up in the listbox).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\explorer\database\30000000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155600				0	sk	Work through the steps in the remaining pages of the Database Wizard.				20200411 15:09:53
