helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150298				0	sk	Môžete ovládať $[officename] Math bez myšky.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150343				0	sk	Priame vkladanie vzorcov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3154659				0	sk	Ak chcete vložiť vzorec do textu dokumentu a už poznáte korektné zapisovanie, môžete pokračovať nasledovným spôsobom:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153818				0	sk	Zapíšte vzorec do vášho textu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3153915				0	sk	Označte vzorec				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150213				0	sk	Choose the command \<emph\>Insert - Object - Formula\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154767				0	sk	Vloženie vzorcov s použitím okna				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149875				0	sk	If you want to use the $[officename] Math interface to edit a formula, choose the command \<emph\>Insert - Object - Formula\</emph\> without any text selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150391				0	sk	Kurzor čaká na príkazy v okne pre zapísanie vzorcov.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3150537				0	sk	You can compose formulas using the Elements window. Open it with the menu \<emph\>View - Elements\</emph\> if it is not already open.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	sk	If the Elements window is open, use F6 to switch from the Commands window to the Elements window and back.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154554				0	sk	Elements window				20200411 15:09:53
