helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153505				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_NEGX\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>Boolean NOT\</emph\> with one placeholder.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\>neg<?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN10383				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3147116\" src=\"starmath/res/un21214.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3147116\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3149847				0	sk	Booleovské AND				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147599				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_SMA_XANDY\"\>Inserts a \<emph\>Boolean AND\</emph\> with two placeholders.\</ahelp\> You can also type \<emph\><?>and<?>\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\03090100.xhp	0	help	par_idN103C3				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3148440\" src=\"starmath/res/un21215.png\" width=\"0.3335inch\" height=\"0.3335inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3148440\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
