helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\05030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3154799				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH:CHECKBOX:RID_DISTANCEDIALOG:1\"\>Scales all types of brackets.\</ahelp\> If you then enter \<emph\>( a over b)\</emph\> in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window, the brackets will surround the whole height of the argument. You normally achieve this effect by entering \<emph\>left ( a over b right )\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
