helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Upraviť symboly				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	bm_id2123477				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>new symbols in %PRODUCTNAME Math\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>symbols; adding in %PRODUCTNAME Math\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151075				0	sk	Upraviť symboly				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154513				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_MODALDIALOG_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG\"\>Use this dialog to add symbols to a symbol set, to edit symbol sets, or to modify symbol notations.\</ahelp\> You can also define new symbol sets, assign names to symbols, or to modify existing symbol sets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146066				0	sk	Pôvodný symbol				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153965				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Select the name of the current symbol.\</ahelp\> The symbol, the name of the symbol, and the set that the symbol belongs to are displayed in the left preview pane at the bottom of the dialog box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154020				0	sk	Sada pôvodných symbolov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150209				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_2\"\>This list box contains the name of the current symbol set. If you want, you can also select a different symbol set.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145386				0	sk	Symbol				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3148870				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_4\"\>Lists the names for the symbols in the current symbol set. Select a name from the list or type a name for a newly added symbol.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150215				0	sk	Pridať nový symbol				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3143233				0	sk	To add a symbol to a symbol set, select a font in the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> box, and then click a symbol in symbols pane. In the \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\> box, type a name for the symbol. In the \<emph\>Symbol set\</emph\> list box, select a symbol set, or type a new name to create a new symbol set. The right preview pane displays the symbol that you selected. Click \<emph\>Add\</emph\> and then \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3151389				0	sk	Modifikovanie názvu symbolu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147296				0	sk	To change the name of a symbol, select the old name in the \<emph\>Old symbol\</emph\> list box. Then enter the new name in the \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\> box. Check whether the desired character is in the preview window before you click the \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> button. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3157870				0	sk	Symbol Set				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145825				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_5\"\>The \<emph\>Symbol set\</emph\> list box contains the names of all existing symbol sets. You can modify a symbol set or create a new one.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154554				0	sk	Tvorba novej sady symbolov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145594				0	sk	To create a new symbol set, type a name for it in the \<emph\>Symbol set\</emph\> list box and add at least one symbol. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to close the dialog. The new symbol set is now available under the new name.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153736				0	sk	Písmo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147374				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Displays the name of the current font and enables you to select a different font.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150564				0	sk	Podmnožina				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145295				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_LISTBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_LB_FONTS_SUBSET\"\>If you selected a non-symbol font in the \<emph\>Font\</emph\> list box, you can select a Unicode subset in which to place your new or edited symbol. When a subset has been selected, all symbols belonging to this subset of the current symbol set are displayed in the symbols list above.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148386				0	sk	Typ písma				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155366				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_COMBOBOX_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_3\"\>The current typeface is displayed. You can change the typeface by selecting one from the list box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156262				0	sk	Pridať				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153922				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_1\"\>Click this button to add the symbol shown in the right preview window to the current symbol set.\</ahelp\> It will be saved under the name displayed in the \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\> list box. You must specify a name under \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\> or \<emph\>Symbol Set\</emph\> to be able to use this button. Names cannot be used more than once.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150756				0	sk	Upraviť				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3147570				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_2\"\>Click this button to replace the name of the symbol shown in the left preview window (the old name is displayed in the \<emph\>Old symbol\</emph\> list box) with the new name you have entered in the \<emph\>Symbol\</emph\> list box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154640				0	sk	Presun symbolu k inej sade symbolov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3151174				0	sk	As an example, to transfer the large ALPHA from the "Greek" set to the "Special" set, select the old set (Greek) and then the ALPHA symbol using the two top list boxes. The symbol appears in the left preview window. In the \<emph\>Symbol set\</emph\> list box, select the "Special" set. Click \<emph\>Modify\</emph\> and then \<emph\>OK\</emph\>. The ALPHA symbol is now only in the "Special" symbol set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145414				0	sk	Zmazať				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154258				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"STARMATH_PUSHBUTTON_RID_SYMDEFINEDIALOG_3\"\>Click to remove the symbol shown in the left preview window from the current symbol set.\</ahelp\> There will be no security query. Deleting the last remaining symbol of a symbol set also deletes the symbol set.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153527				0	sk	You can also click \<emph\>Cancel\</emph\> at any time to close the dialog without saving any of the changes.				20200411 15:09:53
