helpcontent2	source\text\smath\01\06010000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153917				0	sk	When a symbol is selected, its command name appears below the symbol list and a magnified version appears in a box to the right. Note that the name must be typed in the \<emph\>Commands\</emph\> window exactly as displayed here (case-sensitive).				20200411 15:09:53
