helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150048				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SCH:METRICFIELD:TP_STAT:MTR_FLD_PERCENT\"\>Displays a percentage. The display refers to the corresponding data point. Set the percentage in the Parameters area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
