helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id5154576				0	sk	Standard Error: Displays the standard error.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3157979				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Variance: Displays the variance calculated from the number of data points and respective values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153249				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Standard Deviation: Displays the standard deviation (square root of the variance).\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149870				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Error Margin: Displays the highest error margin in percent according to the highest value of the data group. Set the percentage in the Parameters area.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id350962				0	sk	Cell Range				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id6679586				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Click Cell Range and then specify a cell range from which to take the positive and negative error bar values.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id3872188				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Click a button to shrink the dialog, then use the mouse to select the cell range in the spreadsheet. Click the button again to restore the dialog to full size.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	hd_id2633747				0	sk	Z tabuľky dát				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id6633503				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>For a chart with its own data, the error bar values can be entered in the chart data table. The Data Table dialog shows additional columns titled Positive Y-Error-Bars and Negative Y-Error-Bars.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\04050000.xhp	0	help	par_id0428200810573839				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the value to add to the displayed value as the positive error value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
