helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3145750				0	sk	Use this to change the properties of a selected data series. This dialog appears when one data series is selected when you choose \<emph\>Format - Format Selection\</emph\>. Some of the menu entries are only available for 2D or 3D charts.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\05010200.xhp	0	help	par_id3154015				0	sk	Any changes made here affect the entire data series. For example, if you change the color, all elements belonging to this data series will change color.				20200411 15:09:53
