helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id4411145				0	sk	To enter chart elements				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3274941				0	sk	Enter titles or click the elements that you want to be shown on the current chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	hd_id9804681				0	sk	Titulky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id3614917				0	sk	If you enter text for a title, subtitle, or any axis, the necessary space will be reserved to display the text next to the chart. If you do not enter a text, no space will be reserved, leaving more space to display the chart.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id156865				0	sk	It is not possible to link the title text to a cell. You must enter the text directly.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6034424				0	sk	When the chart is finished, you can change the position and other properties by the \<emph\>Format\</emph\> menu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id9033783				0	sk	Legenda				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id1069368				0	sk	The legend displays the labels from the first row or column, or from the range that you have set in the Data Series dialog. If your chart does not contain labels, the legend displays text like "Row 1, Row 2, ...", or "Column A, Column B, ..." according to the row number or column letter of the chart data.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id6998809				0	sk	You cannot enter the text directly, it is automatically generated from the Name cell range.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\schart\01\wiz_chart_elements.xhp	0	help	par_id71413				0	sk	Select one of the position options. When the chart is finished, you can specify other positions using the Format menu.				20200411 15:09:53
