helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\02\10070000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155369				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CirclePie\"\>Draws a filled shape that is defined by the arc of a circle and two radius lines in the current document. To draw a circle pie, drag a circle to the size you want, and then click to define the first radius line. Move your pointer to where you want to place the second radius line and click. You do not need to click on the circle. To draw an ellipse pie, hold down Shift while you drag.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
