helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id5703909				0	sk	You see four areas on this dialog with check boxes for Header, Date and time, Footer, and Page number. These four areas correspond to the four areas in the corners of the handout master view.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\printing.xhp	0	help	par_id4984282				0	sk	Enter text for header, footer, and date. Check the \<emph\>Page number\</emph\> box, if you want to number the handout pages. Ensure the \<emph\>Header\</emph\> check box is enabled if you want your header text to be printed.				20200411 15:09:53
