helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\line_edit.xhp	0	help	par_id3155959				0	sk	To view the data points and control points of a curved line, select the line, and then click the \<emph\>Points\</emph\> icon on the Drawing bar. The data points are represented by squares and the control points by circles. A control point might overlay a data point.				20200411 15:09:53
