helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150395				0	sk	In $[officename] Impress, right-click the border of the text object, and then choose \<emph\>Convert - To Curve\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150746				0	sk	Ak váš text obsahuje viac ako jeden znak, prevedený text sa stane zoskupeným objektom. Dvojitým kliknutím na tento zoskupený objekt do neho vstúpite. Teraz môžete upravovať jednotlivé objekty v ňom obsiahnuté. Po skončení úprav stlačte Esc.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\text2curve.xhp	0	help	par_id3150336				0	sk	Now, click the \<emph\>Points\</emph\> icon on the \<emph\>Drawing\</emph\> bar. Click the object. You can see all the Bézier points of the object. On the \<emph\>Edit Points\</emph\> bar, you can find various icons for editing, inserting and deleting points.				20200411 15:09:53
