helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107ED				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Displays the start property of the selected animation effect.\</ahelp\> The following start properties are available:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107F3				0	sk	\<emph\>On click\</emph\> - the animation stops at this effect until the next mouse click.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN107FA				0	sk	\<emph\>With previous\</emph\> - the animation runs immediately.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10801				0	sk	\<emph\>After previous\</emph\> - the animation runs as soon as the previous animation ends.				20200411 15:09:53
