helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\01\04030000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752				0	sk	\<variable id=\"fangtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:CapturePoint\"\>Inserts a snap point or snap line (also known as guide) that you can use to quickly align objects.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> Snap points and snap lines do not appear in printed output.				20200411 15:09:53
