helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\04\01020000.xhp	0	help	par_idN10B00				0	sk	Adds the previous sheet to the current selection of sheets. If all the sheets in a spreadsheet are selected, this shortcut key combination only selects the previous sheet. Makes the previous sheet the current sheet.				20200411 15:09:53
