helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\datapilot_deletetable.xhp	0	help	par_id3154014				0	sk	In order to delete a pivot table, click any cell in the pivot table, then choose \<emph\>Delete\</emph\> in the context menu.				20200411 15:09:53
