helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id2918485				0	sk	Click one of the \<emph\>Default\</emph\> icons to set or reset multiple borders.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id1836909				0	sk	The thin gray lines inside an icon show the borders that will be reset or cleared.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id5212561				0	sk	The dark lines inside an icon show the lines that will be set using the selected line style and color.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id4818872				0	sk	The thick gray lines inside an icon show the lines that will not be changed.				20200411 15:09:53
