helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id4018066				0	sk	In the \<emph\>User defined\</emph\> area, you can click to set or remove individual lines. The preview shows lines in three different states. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id8004699				0	sk	Repeatedly click an edge or a corner to switch through the three different states.				20200411 15:09:53
