helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\borders.xhp	0	help	par_id6987823				0	sk	A black line sets the corresponding line of the selected cells. The line is shown as a dotted line when you choose the 0.05 pt line style. Double lines are shown when you select a double line style.				20200411 15:09:53
