helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id7116611				0	sk	Place the cursor in the cell to be split.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\table_cellmerge.xhp	0	help	par_id9493087				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>Format - Merge Cells\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
