helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\text_rotate.xhp	0	help	par_id3147426				0	sk	In the \<emph\>Text orientation\</emph\> area use the mouse to select in the preview wheel the direction in which the text is to be rotated. Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
