helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id121020081121549				0	sk	If you select a range of cells, only these cells will get sorted. If you just click one cell without selecting, then the whole database range will get sorted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_sort.xhp	0	help	par_idN10635				0	sk	Choose \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Data - Sort\</item\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\database_sort.xhp	0	help	par_id121020081121547				0	sk	The range of cells that will get sorted is shown in inverted colors.				20200411 15:09:53
