helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id2298959				0	sk	=B1=0 => TRUE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4653767				0	sk	=B1="" => TRUE (MS-Excel: FALSE)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id8801538				0	sk	C1: =VLOOKUP(...) with empty cell result => displays empty (MS-Excel: displays 0)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id6746421				0	sk	=ISNUMBER(VLOOKUP(...)) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\05\empty_cells.xhp	0	help	par_id4876247				0	sk	=ISTEXT(VLOOKUP(...)) => FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
