helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060111.xhp	0	help	par_id3166467				0	sk	\<emph\>Type\</emph\> calculates the type of difference. The possible values are 0 (interval) and 1 (in numbers of weeks).				20200411 15:09:53
