helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\solver_options.xhp	0	help	par_id130619				0	sk	In the Settings box, check all settings that you want to use for the current goal seeking operation. If the current option offers different values, the Edit button is enabled. Click Edit to open a dialog where you can change the value.				20200411 15:09:53
