helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05030300.xhp	0	help	par_id8337046				0	sk	Select the range that includes the hidden objects. You can also use the box in the corner above row 1 and beside column A. For sheets, this step is not necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
