helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3145596				0	sk	Number format from the "Default" cell style				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3152785				0	sk	1				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3154380				0	sk	Data are always interpreted in the standard format for US English				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060109.xhp	0	help	par_id3150279				0	sk	2				20200411 15:09:53
