helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_id3152899				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC_METRICFIELD_RID_SCPAGE_TABLE_ED_SCALEALL\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter a scaling factor. Factors less than 100 reduce the pages, higher factors enlarge the pages.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
