helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109B5				0	sk	Specifies the maximum number of pages horizontally (width) and vertically (height) on which every sheet with the current Page Style is to be printed. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BB				0	sk	The print ranges are always scaled proportionally, so the resulting number of pages may be less than specified.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109BF				0	sk	You may clear one of the boxes, then the unspecified dimension will use as many pages as necessary.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05070500.xhp	0	help	par_idN109C3				0	sk	If you clear both boxes, this will result in a scaling factor of 100%.				20200411 15:09:53
