helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10712				0	sk	Typ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10716				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371266\"\>Select the type of calculating of the displayed value for the data field.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10724				0	sk	Typ				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1072A				0	sk	Zobrazená hodnota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10731				0	sk	Normálne				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10737				0	sk	Results are shown unchanged				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1073E				0	sk	Rozdiel od				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10744				0	sk	From each result, its reference value (see below) is subtracted, and the difference is shown. Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10747				0	sk	\<emph\>Named item\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074C				0	sk	If a base item name is specified, the reference value for a combination of field items is the result where the item in the base field is replaced by the specified base item.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1074F				0	sk	\<emph\>Previous item or Next item\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10754				0	sk	If "previous item" or "next item" is specified as the base item, the reference value is the result for the next visible member of the base field, in the base field's sort order.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1075B				0	sk	% Of				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10761				0	sk	Each result is divided by its reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1076A				0	sk	% Difference from				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10770				0	sk	From each result, its reference value is subtracted, and the difference is divided by the reference value. The reference value is determined in the same way as for "Difference from". Totals outside of the base field are shown as empty results.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10777				0	sk	Celkom beží v				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1077D				0	sk	Each result is added to the sum of the results for preceding items in the base field, in the base field's sort order, and the total sum is shown.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10780				0	sk	Results are always summed, even if a different summary function was used to get each result.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10787				0	sk	% riadkov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1078D				0	sk	Each result is divided by the total result for its row in the pivot table. If there are several data fields, the total for the result's data field is used. If there are subtotals with manually selected summary functions, the total with the data field's summary function is still used. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN10794				0	sk	% stĺpcov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN1079A				0	sk	Same as "% of row", but the total for the result's column is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A1				0	sk	% celkovo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107A7				0	sk	Same as "% of row", but the grand total for the result's data field is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107AE				0	sk	Index				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B4				0	sk	The row and column totals and the grand total, following the same rules as above, are used to calculate the following expression:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107B7				0	sk	( original result * grand total ) / ( row total * column total )				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BA				0	sk	Base field				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107BE				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371267\"\>Select the field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
