helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090105.xhp	0	help	par_idN107C5				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"1495371268\"\>Select the item of the base field from which the respective value is taken as base for the calculation.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
