helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3156014	383			0	sk	            \<emph\>Settlement\</emph\> is the date of purchase of the security.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154304	384			0	sk	            \<emph\>Maturity\</emph\> is the date on which the security matures (expires).				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3159180	385			0	sk	            \<emph\>Price\</emph\> is the price of the security per 100 currency units of par value.				20200411 15:09:53
