helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3148907	418			0	sk	            \<emph\>NominalRate\</emph\> is the annual nominal rate of interest.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3154274	419			0	sk	            \<emph\>NPerY \</emph\>is the number of interest payments per year.				20200411 15:09:53
