helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060103.xhp	0	help	par_id3149558				0	sk	For a credit amount of 120,000 currency units with a two-year term and monthly installments, at a yearly interest rate of 12% the level of interest after 1.5 years is required.				20200411 15:09:53
