helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3150001	26			0	sk	            \<emph\>Value1; Value2, ...\</emph\> are 1 to 30 arguments representing the values to be counted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150334				0	sk	Príklad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3154508				0	sk	The entries 2, 4, 6 and eight in the Value 1-4 fields are to be counted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3158000	29			0	sk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=COUNTA(2;4;6;"eight")\</item\> = 4. The count of values is therefore 4.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150267				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>B function\</bookmark_value\>         \<bookmark_value\>probabilities of samples with binomial distribution\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
