helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3156061				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_B\"\>Returns the probability of a sample with binomial distribution.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
