helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3150470	47			0	sk	            \<emph\>DataY\</emph\> is an array or range of data points.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3153181	48			0	sk	            \<emph\>DataX\</emph\> is an array or range of data points.				20200411 15:09:53
