helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060181.xhp	0	help	par_id3155991	50			0	sk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=RSQ(A1:A20;B1:B20)\</item\> calculates the determination coefficient for both data sets in columns A and B.				20200411 15:09:53
