helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3155823				0	sk	YEARFRAC(StartDate; EndDate; Basis)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3145144				0	sk	\<emph\>StartDate\</emph\> and \<emph\>EndDate\</emph\> are two date values.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_yearfrac.xhp	0	help	par_id3149954				0	sk	\<emph\>Basis\</emph\> is chosen from a list of options and indicates how the year is to be calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
