helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150542	2			0	sk	\<variable id=\"zelleneinfuegentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:InsertCell\"\>Opens the\<emph\> Insert Cells \</emph\>dialog, in which you can insert new cells according to the options that you specify.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> You can delete cells by choosing \<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02160000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Delete Cells\"\>\<emph\>Edit - Delete Cells\</emph\>\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153768				0	sk	Výber				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149262				0	sk	This area contains the options available for inserting cells into a sheet. The cell quantity and position is defined by selecting a cell range in the sheet beforehand.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146120				0	sk	Posunúť bunky nadol				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3152596				0	sk	\<variable id=\"zellenuntentext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_CELLSDOWN\"\>Moves the contents of the selected range downward when cells are inserted.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147434				0	sk	Posunúť bunky doprava				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3144764				0	sk	\<variable id=\"zellenrechtstext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_CELLSRIGHT\"\>Moves the contents of the selected range to the right when cells are inserted.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153877				0	sk	Celý riadok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155417				0	sk	\<variable id=\"zeilenganzetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_INSROWS\"\>Inserts an entire row. The position of the row is determined by the selection on the sheet.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The number of rows inserted depends on how many rows are selected. The contents of the original rows are moved downward.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3146971				0	sk	Celý stĺpec				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04020000.xhp	0	help	par_id3155068				0	sk	\<variable id=\"spaltenganzetext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_INSCELL:BTN_INSCOLS\"\>Inserts an entire column. The number of columns to be inserted is determined by the selected number of columns.\</ahelp\>\</variable\> The contents of the original columns are shifted to the right.				20200411 15:09:53
