helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153551				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_DATUM\"\>This function calculates a date specified by year, month, day and displays it in the cell's formatting.\</ahelp\> The default format of a cell containing the DATE function is the date format, but you can format the cells with any other number format.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148590				0	sk	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3150474				0	sk	DATE(Year; Month; Day)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3152815				0	sk	\<emph\>Year\</emph\> is an integer between 1583 and 9957 or between 0 and 99.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153222				0	sk	In \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - $[officename] - General \</item\>you can set from which year a two-digit number entry is recognized as 20xx.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3155817				0	sk	\<emph\>Month\</emph\> is an integer indicating the month.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3153183				0	sk	\<emph\>Day\</emph\> is an integer indicating the day of the month.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3156260				0	sk	If the values for month and day are out of bounds, they are carried over to the next digit. If you enter \<item type=\"input\"\>=DATE(00;12;31)\</item\> the result will be 12/31/00. If, on the other hand, you enter \<item type=\"input\"\>=DATE(00;13;31)\</item\> the result will be 1/31/01.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147477				0	sk	Príklad				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_date.xhp	0	help	par_id3152589				0	sk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DATE(00;1;31)\</item\> yields 1/31/00 if the cell format setting is MM/DD/YY.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Konsolidovať				20200411 15:09:53
