helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3154909				0	sk	Use this section if the cell ranges that you want to consolidate contain labels. You only need to select these options if the consolidation ranges contain similar labels and the data arranged is arranged differently.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153968				0	sk	Popisy riadka				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3150441				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONSOLIDATE:BTN_BYROW\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Uses the row labels to arrange the consolidated data.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
