helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONSOLIDATE:BTN_BYCOL\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Uses the column labels to arrange the consolidated data.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153191				0	sk	Možnosti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3159154				0	sk	Odkaz na zdrojové údaje				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12070100.xhp	0	help	par_id3146986				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:CHECKBOX:RID_SCDLG_CONSOLIDATE:BTN_REFS\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Links the data in the consolidation range to the source data, and automatically updates the results of the consolidation when the source data is changed.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
