helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3149287				0	sk	HARMEAN(Number1; Number2; ...Number30)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060182.xhp	0	help	par_id3154303	117			0	sk	            \<emph\>Number1,Number2,...Number30\</emph\> are up to 30 values or ranges, that can be used to calculate the harmonic mean.				20200411 15:09:53
