helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\03090000.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	sk	If the Formula Bar is hidden, you can still edit cells by activating the edit mode with F2. After editing cells, accept the changes by pressing Enter, or discard entries by pressing Esc. Esc is also used to exit the edit mode.				20200411 15:09:53
