helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152374	49			0	sk	            \<emph\>Text\</emph\> is the text where the search takes place.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060110.xhp	0	help	par_id3152475	50			0	sk	            \<emph\>Position\</emph\> (optional) is the position in the text from which the search starts.				20200411 15:09:53
