helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056C				0	sk	Specifies the start of the grouping.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1056F				0	sk	Automaticky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10573				0	sk	Specifies whether to start grouping at the smallest value.				20200411 15:09:53
