helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057A				0	sk	Specifies whether to enter the start value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1057D				0	sk	Koniec				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10581				0	sk	Specifies the end of the grouping.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10584				0	sk	Automaticky				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10588				0	sk	Specifies whether to end grouping at the largest value.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058B				0	sk	Manually at				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1058F				0	sk	Specifies whether to enter the end value for grouping yourself.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10592				0	sk	Zoskupiť podľa				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10596				0	sk	Specifies the value range by which every group's limits are calculated.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN10599				0	sk	Number of days				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12090400.xhp	0	help	par_idN1059D				0	sk	In the case of grouping date values, specifies the number of days to group by.				20200411 15:09:53
