helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3145069				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:AutoOutline\"\>If the selected cell range contains formulas or references, $[officename] automatically outlines the selection.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12080500.xhp	0	help	par_id3148798				0	sk	For example, consider the following table:				20200411 15:09:53
