helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eastersunday.xhp	0	help	par_id3154570				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_OSTERSONNTAG\"\>Returns the date of Easter Sunday for the entered year.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
