helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id9305398				0	sk	Type = 0 means descending from the last item of the array to the first (this is the default), 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060185.xhp	0	help	par_id9996948				0	sk	Type = 1 means ascending from the first item of the range to the last.				20200411 15:09:53
