helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_id3153904				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_XNPV\"\>Calculates the capital value (net present value)for a list of payments which take place on different dates.\</ahelp\> The calculation is based on a 365 days per year basis, ignoring leap years.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060118.xhp	0	help	par_idN11138				0	sk	If the payments take place at regular intervals, use the NPV function.				20200411 15:09:53
