helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_eomonth.xhp	0	help	par_id3152766	232			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_AAI_FUNC_EOMONTH\"\>Returns the date of the last day of a month which falls m\<emph\>onths\</emph\> away from the s\<emph\>tart date\</emph\>.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
