helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3150868				0	sk	\<variable id=\"beschtext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:DefineLabelRange\"\>Opens a dialog in which you can define a label range.\</ahelp\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3155411				0	sk	The cell contents of a label range can be used like names in formulas - $[officename] recognizes these names in the same manner that it does the predefined names of the weekdays and months. These names are automatically completed when typed into a formula. In addition, the names defined by label ranges will have priority over names defined by automatically generated ranges.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	par_id3147435				0	sk	You can set label ranges that contain the same labels on different sheets. $[officename] first searches the label ranges of the current sheet and, following a failed search, the ranges of other sheets.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04070400.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145801				0	sk	Oblasť				20200411 15:09:53
