helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_today.xhp	0	help	par_id3153759				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_HEUTE\"\>Returns the current computer system date.\</ahelp\> The value is updated when you reopen the document or modify the values of the document.				20200411 15:09:53
