helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153764				0	sk	Vľavo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156382				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_LEFT\"\>Creates a series running from right to left in the selected cell range using the defined increment to the end value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3147344				0	sk	Series Type				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149257	15			0	sk	Defines the series type. Choose between \<emph\>Linear, Growth, Date \</emph\>and \<emph\>AutoFill\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148488				0	sk	Lineárny				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3159238				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_ARITHMETIC\"\>Creates a linear number series using the defined increment and end value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149210				0	sk	Rast				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150364				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_GEOMETRIC\"\>Creates a growth series using the defined increment and end value.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149528				0	sk	Dátum				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150887				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DATE\"\>Creates a date series using the defined increment and end date.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150202				0	sk	Automatické vyplňovanie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3156288				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_AUTOFILL\"\>Forms a series directly in the sheet.\</ahelp\> The AutoFill function takes account of customized lists. For example, by entering \<emph\>January\</emph\> in the first cell, the series is completed using the list defined under \<emph\>\<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>%PRODUCTNAME - Preferences\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Tools - Options\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\> - %PRODUCTNAME Calc - Sort Lists\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3155811				0	sk	AutoFill tries to complete a value series by using a defined pattern. The series 1,3,5 is automatically completed with 7,9,11,13, and so on. Date and time series are completed accordingly; for example, after 01.01.99 and 15.01.99, an interval of 14 days is used.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148700				0	sk	Unit of Time				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153308				0	sk	In this area you can specify the desired unit of time. This area is only active if the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> option has been chosen in the \<emph\>Series type\</emph\> area.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3148868				0	sk	Deň				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3148605				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DAY\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series using seven days.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3144771				0	sk	Pracobný deň				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3150108				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_DAY_OF_WEEK\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series of five day sets.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154957				0	sk	Mesiac				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149126				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_MONTH\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to form a series from the names or abbreviations of the months.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152870				0	sk	Rok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3151300				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:RADIOBUTTON:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:BTN_YEAR\"\>Use the \<emph\>Date\</emph\> series type and this option to create a series of years.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3154762				0	sk	Start Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3149381				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_START_VALUES\"\>Determines the start value for the series.\</ahelp\> Use numbers, dates or times.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153013				0	sk	End Value				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3153487				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_END_VALUES\"\>Determines the end value for the series.\</ahelp\> Use numbers, dates or times.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149312				0	sk	Prírastok				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140600.xhp	0	help	par_id3154739				0	sk	The term "increment" denotes the amount by which a given value increases.\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_FILLSERIES:ED_INCREMENT\"\> Determines the value by which the series of the selected type increases by each step.\</ahelp\> Entries can only be made if the linear, growth or date series types have been selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Dole				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150792				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/scalc/01/02140100.xhp\" name=\"Down\"\>Down\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153969				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FillDown\" visibility=\"visible\"\>Fills a selected range of at least two rows with the contents of the top cell of the range.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\02140100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145787				0	sk	If a selected range has only one column, the contents of the top cell are copied to all others. If several columns are selected, the contents of the corresponding top cell will be copied down.				20200411 15:09:53
