helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155985				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_WAHR\"\>The logical value is set to TRUE.\</ahelp\> The TRUE() function does not require any arguments, and always returns the logical value TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
