helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3146148				0	sk	If A=TRUE and B=FALSE the following examples appear:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3083285	44			0	sk	           \<item type=\"input\"\>=AND(A;B)\</item\> returns FALSE				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3083444	45			0	sk	            \<item type=\"input\"\>=OR(A;B)\</item\> returns TRUE				20200411 15:09:53
