helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3149727	52			0	sk	            \<emph\>Test\</emph\> is any value or expression that can be TRUE or FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3155828	53			0	sk	            \<emph\>ThenValue\</emph\> (optional) is the value that is returned if the logical test is TRUE.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060105.xhp	0	help	par_id3154811	54			0	sk	            \<emph\>OtherwiseValue\</emph\> (optional) is the value that is returned if the logical test is FALSE.				20200411 15:09:53
