helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3151285				0	sk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=GCD(16;32;24) \</item\>gives the result 8, because 8 is the largest number that can divide 16, 24 and 32 without a remainder.				20200411 15:09:53
