helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	bm_id3163596				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>SUM function\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>adding;numbers in cell ranges\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
