helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3163625				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_SUMME\"\>Adds all the numbers in a range of cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
