helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151246				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Combines the selected cells into a single cell or splits merged cells.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3148552				0	sk	The merged cell receives the name of the first cell of the original cell range. Merged cells cannot be merged a second time with other cells. The range must form a rectangle, multiple selection is not supported.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\05060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3149665				0	sk	If the cells to be merged have any contents, a security dialog is shown.				20200411 15:09:53
