helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3147273				0	sk	=PRICE("1999-02-15"; "2007-11-15"; 0.0575; 0.065; 100; 2; 0) returns 95.04287.				20200411 15:09:53
