helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3145777				0	sk	What is the nominal rate of interest for a 5.3543% effective rate of interest and quarterly payment.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3156146				0	sk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=NOMINAL_ADD(5.3543%;4)\</item\> returns 0.0525 or 5.25%.				20200411 15:09:53
