helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	par_id3148563				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_FUNC_RMZ\"\>Returns the periodic payment for an annuity with constant interest rates.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060119.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145257				0	sk	Syntax				20200411 15:09:53
