helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147099				0	sk	To find the variance of the weight for all children of the same age at Joe's birthday party (scroll up, please), enter the following formula in B16:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3147322				0	sk	\<item type=\"input\"\>=DVARP(A1:E10;"Váha";A13:E14)\</item\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146902				0	sk	In row 14, under Age, enter \<item type=\"input\"\>7, 8, 9,\</item\> and so on, one after the other. The variance of the weight values for all children of this age attending Joe's birthday party appears.				20200411 15:09:53
