helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\func_days.xhp	0	help	par_id3151376				0	sk	\<emph\>Date1\</emph\> is the start date, \<emph\>Date2\</emph\> is the end date. If \<emph\>Date2\</emph\> is an earlier date than \<emph\>Date1\</emph\> the result is a negative number.				20200411 15:09:53
