helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3163807				0	sk	Dáta				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3144502	10			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:LISTBOX:TP_VALIDATION_VALUES:LB_VALUE\"\>Select the comparative operator that you want to use.\</ahelp\> The available operators depend on what you selected in the \<emph\>Allow \</emph\>box. If you select "between" or "not between", the \<emph\>Minimum\</emph\> and \<emph\>Maximum\</emph\> input boxes appear. Otherwise, only the \<emph\>Minimum\</emph\>, the \<emph\>Maximum, or the Value\</emph\> input boxes appear.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3153782				0	sk	Hodnota				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153266	12			0	sk	Enter the value for the data validation option that you selected in the \<emph\>Allow \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149814				0	sk	Minimum				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\12120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3153199	14			0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:TP_VALIDATION_VALUES:EDT_MIN\"\>Enter the minimum value for the data validation option that you selected in the \<emph\>Allow \</emph\>box.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
