helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3152992				0	sk	Vyberte farebný model RGB alebo CMYK v poli pod poľami s náhľadom.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id4979705				0	sk	%PRODUCTNAME používa pre farebnú tlač len farebný model RGB. Ovládacie prvky CMYK sú zahrnuté len na uľahčenie zadávania hodnôt farieb v CMYK notácii.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3152987	16			0	sk	V modeli RGB sa pomocou červenej (R), zelenej (G) a modrej (B) farby vytvárajú farby na obrazovke počítača. V RGB modeli sa tri komponenty sčítajú a môžu mať hodnotu od 0 (čierna) po 255 (biela). V modeli CMYK sa pomocou azúrovej (C), purpurovej (M), žltej (Y) a čiernej (K) pripravujú farby pre tlač. Štyri farby CMYK modelu sa odčítavajú a určujú sa percentá. Čierna zodpovedá 100 % a biela 0 %.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3145386				0	sk	Do políčok vedľa farebných zložiek zadajte číselné hodnoty. Nová farba sa zobrazí v náhľadovom okne priamo nad výberom farebného modelu.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3152871				0	sk	You can also create a color using a color spectrum. Click the \<emph\>Edit\</emph\> button to open the \<link href=\"text/shared/optionen/01010501.xhp\" name=\"Color\"\>\<emph\>Color\</emph\>\</link\> dialog. Click a color. Use the Hue, Saturation, and Brightness boxes to adjust your color selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3153011				0	sk	Vykonajte jednu z nasledujúcich možností:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3147244				0	sk	Ak chcete nahradiť v štandardnej tabuľke farbu na ktorej je vaša farba založená, kliknite na \<emph\>Upraviť\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3145116				0	sk	Ak chcete pridať vlastnú farbu do štandardnej tabuľky farieb, zadajte názov do políčka \<emph\>Názov\</emph\> a kliknite na \<emph\>Pridať\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\color_define.xhp	0	help	par_id3145236				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/03170000.xhp\" name=\"Panel farieb\"\>Panel farieb\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Prechod tvarov dvoch objektov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	bm_id3150715				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>objekty kresby; prechod tvarov dvoch objektov\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>prechod tvarov; dva objekty kresby\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150715				0	sk	\<variable id=\"cross_fading\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/cross_fading.xhp\" name=\"Prechod tvarov dvoch objektov\"\>Prechod tvarov dvoch objektov\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3154754				0	sk	Prechod tvarov vytvorí tvary a s rovnomernými rozostupmi ich rozloží medzi dva objekty.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3155112				0	sk	Príkaz na prechod tvarov je k dispozícii len v $[officename] Draw. Je však možné vytvorené tvary skopírovať a vložiť do $[officename] Impress.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149209				0	sk	Ak chcete vytvoriť prechod medzi dvoma objektami:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3150370				0	sk	Podržte kláves Shift a kliknite na každý objekt.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3166428				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>Edit - Cross-fading\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3156450				0	sk	Zadajte hodnotu, ktorá určuje počet objektov medzi začiatočným a koncovým objektom, do poľa \<emph\>Prírastky\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3149405				0	sk	Kliknite na \<emph\>OK\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3151240				0	sk	Zobrazí sa skupina obsahujúca obidva pôvodné objekty a určený počet (prírastky) prechodných objektov.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3159203				0	sk	\<image id=\"img_id3150210\" src=\"res/helpimg/ueberblenden.png\" width=\"74.88mm\" height=\"65.62mm\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3150210\"\>Obrázok prechodu tvarov\</alt\>\</image\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3154766				0	sk	You can edit the individual objects of a group by selecting the group and pressing F3. Press \<switchinline select=\"sys\"\>\<caseinline select=\"MAC\"\>Command\</caseinline\>\<defaultinline\>Ctrl\</defaultinline\>\</switchinline\>+F3 to exit the group editing mode.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\cross_fading.xhp	0	help	par_id3155760				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02150000.xhp\" name=\"Editing - Cross-fading\"\>Editing - Cross-fading\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Duplicating Objects				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	bm_id3145750				0	sk	\<bookmark_value\>doubling draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>draw objects; duplicating\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>duplicating draw objects\</bookmark_value\>\<bookmark_value\>multiplying draw objects\</bookmark_value\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	hd_id3145750				0	sk	\<variable id=\"duplicate_object\"\>\<link href=\"text/sdraw/guide/duplicate_object.xhp\" name=\"Duplicating Objects\"\>Duplicating Objects\</link\>\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149400				0	sk	You can create duplicate or multiple copies of an object. The copies can be identical or can differ in size, color, orientation and location.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153415				0	sk	The following example creates a stack of coins by making multiple copies of a single ellipse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149129				0	sk	Use the \<emph\>Ellipse\</emph\> tool to draw a solid yellow ellipse.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149209				0	sk	Select the ellipse and choose \<emph\>Edit - Duplicate\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145585	9			0	sk	Enter 12 as \<emph\>Number of copies.\</emph\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151192				0	sk	Enter a negative value for the \<emph\>Width\</emph\> and \<emph\>Height\</emph\> so that the coins decrease in size as you go up the stack.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151387				0	sk	To define a color transition for the coins, select different colors in the \<emph\>Start\</emph\> and \<emph\>End\</emph\> boxes. The \<emph\>Start\</emph\> color is applied to the object that you are duplicating.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3149947				0	sk	Click \<emph\>OK\</emph\> to create the duplicates.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\duplicate_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3153935				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/simpress/01/02120000.xhp\" name=\"Edit - Duplicate\"\>Edit - Duplicate\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
