helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3155266	49			0	sk	Click the \<emph\>Text\</emph\> icon \<image id=\"img_id3156450\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_text.png\" width=\"0.1665in\" height=\"0.1665in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156450\"\>Icon\</alt\>\</image\> and move the mouse pointer to where you want to enter the text box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3149052				0	sk	Drag a text box to the size you want in your document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3151194				0	sk	Type or paste your text into the text box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\sdraw\guide\text_enter.xhp	0	help	par_id3145118				0	sk	Double-click the text to edit it or to format text properties, such as font size or font color. Click the border of the text box to edit the object properties, such as border color or arranging in front or behind other objects.				20200411 15:09:53
