helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3151235				0	sk	Anchors the selected item to a character.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155071				0	sk	Na odsek				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155094				0	sk	Anchors the selected item to the current paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155122				0	sk	Na stranu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3155144				0	sk	Anchors the selected item to the current page.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145674				0	sk	Na rámec				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145697				0	sk	Anchors the selected item to the surrounding frame.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\anchor_object.xhp	0	help	par_id3145715				0	sk	When you insert an object, graphic, or frame, an anchor icon appears where the item is anchored. You can position an anchored item by dragging the item to another location. To change the anchoring options of an item, right-click the item, and then choose an option from the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Anchor\</item\> submenu.				20200411 15:09:53
