helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149814				0	sk	You can manually check the spelling and grammar of a text selection or the entire document.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id0525200902184476				0	sk	To check the spelling and the grammar of a text, the appropriate dictionaries must be installed. For many languages three different dictionaries exist: a spellchecker, a hyphenation dictionary, and a thesaurus. Each dictionary covers one language only. Grammar checkers can be downloaded and installed as extensions. See the \<link href=\"https://extensions.openoffice.org/dictionary\"\>extensions web page\</link\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149828				0	sk	The spellcheck starts at the current cursor position, or at the beginning of the text selection.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155859				0	sk	Click in the document, or select the text that you want to check.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149836				0	sk	Choose \<emph\>Tools - Spelling and Grammar\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156104				0	sk	When a possible spelling error is encountered, the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Spellcheck\</item\> dialog opens and $[officename] offers some suggested corrections.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3149861				0	sk	Vykonajte jednu z nasledujúcich možností:				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3145099				0	sk	To accept a correction, click the suggestion, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156241				0	sk	Edit the sentence in the upper text box, and then click \<emph\>Change\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3155886				0	sk	To add the unknown word to a user-defined dictionary, click \<emph\>Add\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3147107				0	sk	\<link href=\"text/shared/01/06010000.xhp\" name=\"Spellcheck dialog\"\>Spelling and Grammar dialog\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\spellcheck_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id9625843				0	sk	\<link href=\"https://wiki.openoffice.org/wiki/Documentation/How_Tos/Adding_More_Languages\"\>Wiki page: Adding more languages\</link\>				20200411 15:09:53
