helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3149630				0	sk	Press the right arrow key until the \<emph\>Section\</emph\> icon is selected.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3145100				0	sk	Press the down arrow key, and then press the right arrow key to set the width of the section that you want to insert.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\keyboard.xhp	0	help	par_id3156237				0	sk	Press Enter.				20200411 15:09:53
