helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155605				0	sk	You can modify the heading hierarchy or assign a level in the hierarchy to a custom paragraph style. You can also add chapter and section numbering to heading paragraph styles. By default, the "Heading 1" paragraph style is at the top of the outline hierarchy.				20200411 15:09:53
