helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\chapter_numbering.xhp	0	help	par_id3155891				0	sk	In the \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Paragraph Style\</item\> box, select the heading style that you want to add chapter numbers to.				20200411 15:09:53
