helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN10685				0	sk	Select all the paragraphs you want to exempt, then choose \<emph\>Format - Paragraph - Indents & Spacing\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\registertrue.xhp	0	help	par_idN1068C				0	sk	Open the Styles and Formatting window, click the Paragraph Style you want to exempt, right-click that style, choose \<emph\>Modify\</emph\>. In the dialog, click the \<emph\>Indents & Spacing\</emph\> tab.				20200411 15:09:53
