helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3156021				0	sk	Locate the graphic file that you want to insert, and then click \<emph\>Open\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id3153396				0	sk	By default, the inserted graphic is centered above the paragraph that you clicked in.				20200411 15:09:53
