helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\insert_graphic_fromdraw.xhp	0	help	par_id3145098				0	sk	Hold down \<item type=\"keycode\"\>Ctrl\</item\> and click and hold the object for a moment.				20200411 15:09:53
