helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id4516129				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\"\>Lists the available field types. To add a field to your document, click a field type, click a field in the Selection list, and then click Insert.\</ahelp\> The following fields are available:				20200411 15:09:53
