helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3153134				0	sk	Inserts the number of the page containing the reference target.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3150681				0	sk	Odkaz				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154040				0	sk	Inserts the complete reference target text. For footnotes the footnote number is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149972				0	sk	Nad/Pod				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149619				0	sk	Inserts "above" or "below", depending on the location of the reference target relative to the position of the reference field.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148705				0	sk	Ako štýl strany				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3148728				0	sk	Inserts the number of the page containing the reference target using the format specified in the page style.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id5699942				0	sk	Číslo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6420484				0	sk	Inserts the number of the heading or numbered paragraph, including superior levels depending on the context. See note below this table for more information.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id6986602				0	sk	Číslo (bez kontextu)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id616779				0	sk	Inserts only the number of the heading or numbered paragraph.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id791039				0	sk	Číslo (plný kontext)				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id1953489				0	sk	Inserts the number of the heading or numbered paragraph, including all superior levels.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154635				0	sk	Kapitola				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149646				0	sk	Inserts the number of the chapter containing the reference target.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155553				0	sk	Kategória a číslo				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3155356				0	sk	Inserts the category (caption type) and the number of the reference target. This option is only available when the reference target is an object with a caption.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3154224				0	sk	Text popisu				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3145105				0	sk	Inserts the caption label of the reference target. This option is only available when the reference target is an object with a caption.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3149587				0	sk	Číslovanie				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3146883				0	sk	Inserts the caption number of the reference target. This option is only available when the reference target is an object with a caption.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id757469				0	sk	The "Number" format inserts the number of the heading or numbered paragraph. The superior levels are included depending on the context, as necessary. 				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id5189062				0	sk	For example, when you are in a chapter 1, subchapter 2, subpart 5, this may be numbered as 1.2.5. When you insert here a reference to text in the previous subpart "1.2.4" and you apply the "Number" format, then the reference will be shown as "4". If in this example the numbering is set to show more sublevels, the same reference will be shown as "2.4" or "1.2.4", depending on the setting. If you use the "Number (full context)" format, you will always see "1.2.4", no matter how the numbered paragraph is formatted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	hd_id3156242				0	sk	Názov				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156259				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:EDIT:TP_FLD_REF:ED_REFNAME\"\>Type the name of the user-defined field that you want to create.\</ahelp\> To set a target, click "Set Reference" in the \<emph\>Type\</emph\> list, type a name in this box, and then click \<emph\>Insert\</emph\>. To reference the new target, click the target name in the \<emph\>Selection\</emph\> list.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3156032	17			0	sk	In a master document, targets that are in different sub-documents are not displayed in the\<emph\> Selection\</emph\> list. If you want to insert a reference to the target, you must type the path and the name in the \<emph\>Name \</emph\>box.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id0903200802250745				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Enter the contents that you want to add to a user-defined fields.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090002.xhp	0	help	par_id3159216				0	sk	If you select text in the document, and then insert a reference, the selected text becomes the contents of the field that you insert.				20200411 15:09:53
