helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120100.xhp	0	help	par_id3145783				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"HID_INSERT_IDX_MRK_APPLY_ALL\"\>Automatically marks all other occurrences of the selected text in the document. Text in headers, footers, frames, and captions is not included.\</ahelp\>				20200411 15:09:53
