helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120211.xhp	0	help	par_id3145418				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW:LISTBOX:TP_TOX_SELECT:LB_TYPE\"\>Select the type of index that you want to insert.\</ahelp\> The options available on this tab depend on the index type that you select. If the cursor is in an index when you choose the \<emph\>Insert - Indexes and Tables - Indexes and Tables\</emph\>, you can then edit that index.				20200411 15:09:53
