helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	tit				0	sk	Možnosti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	hd_id3149871				0	sk	Možnosti				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3148569				0	sk	Specifies the number of columns and the column layout for the section.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3151390				0	sk	Sections follow the text flow behavior of the page they are inserted into.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3083448				0	sk	For example, if you insert a section that uses a two-column layout into a page style that uses a four-column layout, the two-column layout is nested inside one of the four columns.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\05040501.xhp	0	help	par_id3155625				0	sk	You can also nest sections, that is, you can insert a section into another section.				20200411 15:09:53
