helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04120212.xhp	0	help	par_id3155962	2			0	sk	\<variable id=\"verzeichnis\"\>The following options are available when you select \<emph\>Alphabetical Index \</emph\>as the \<link href=\"text/swriter/01/04120210.xhp\" name=\"index\"\>index\</link\> type. \</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
