helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04180400.xhp	0	help	par_id3149053				0	sk	\<ahelp hid=\"SW_MODALDIALOG_DLG_CHANGE_DB\"\>Lists the databases that are currently in use.\</ahelp\> The current document contains at least one data field from each of the databases in the list.				20200411 15:09:53
