helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3146865	22			0	sk	You can also insert database fields in the \<emph\>Then \</emph\>and \<emph\>Else \</emph\>boxes using the format "databasename.tablename.fieldname".				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3147583				0	sk	If the table or the field name does not exist in a database, nothing is inserted.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090003.xhp	0	help	par_id3152585				0	sk	If you include the quotes in "databasename.tablename.fieldname", the expression is inserted as text.				20200411 15:09:53
