helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\04090005.xhp	0	help	par_id3154389				0	sk	Inserts a reference point in the document, after which the page count restarts. Select "on" to enable the reference point, and "off" to disable it. You can also enter an offset to start the page count at a different number.				20200411 15:09:53
