helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\06060000.xhp	0	help	par_id3150934				0	sk	Outline numbering is linked to paragraph styles. By default, the "Heading" paragraph styles (1-10) are assigned to the corresponding outline number levels (1-10). If you want, you can assign different paragraph styles to the outline number level.				20200411 15:09:53
