helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151184				0	sk	\<variable id=\"feldbefehltext\"\>\<ahelp hid=\".uno:FieldDialog\"\>Opens a dialog where you can edit the properties of a field. Click in front of a field, and then choose this command.\</ahelp\> In the dialog, you can use the arrow buttons to move to the previous or the next field.\</variable\>				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3151168				0	sk	You can also double-click a field in your document to open the field for editing.				20200411 15:09:53
helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\01\02140000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153668				0	sk	To change the view between field names and field contents in your document, choose \<emph\>View - Fields\</emph\>.				20200411 15:09:53
